 persona, charming stories and misplaced sense of logic will have you rolling in the aisles.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:412:\"“My wife doesn\'t know that I do stand-up comedy. I told her a false name when I married to her. She will never find out. This is the only small secret I keep apart from other big ones.”\n\nComedy Store veteran Mark (not his real name) has been performing for four years, apart from several spent in Germany. His absurd persona, charming stories and misplaced sense of logic will have you rolling in the aisles.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"59\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Mark Silcox, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Mark Silcox, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"406\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Mark-Silcox.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Mark-Silcox.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"43123\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1373494995\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411268312,1),('field:node:104','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411272629,1),('field:node:105','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:214:\"In his build-up to yet another sell-out show at this year’s Edinburgh Fringe, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome pro comedian Sean McLoughlin, veteran of countless top comedy venues throughout the UK.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:214:\"In his build-up to yet another sell-out show at this year’s Edinburgh Fringe, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome pro comedian Sean McLoughlin, veteran of countless top comedy venues throughout the UK.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\