 in a brilliant atmosphere and at a very reasonable price.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"14\";s:3:\"alt\";s:17:\"A Great Night Out\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Night Out Icon\";s:5:\"width\";s:2:\"40\";s:6:\"height\";s:2:\"40\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:26:\"1360291128_kmoon_40x40.png\";s:3:\"uri\";s:49:\"public://article-image/1360291128_kmoon_40x40.png\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:4:\"2521\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371337632\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"12\";s:3:\"alt\";s:17:\"A Great Night Out\";s:5:\"title\";s:17:\"A Great Night Out\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"900\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"554\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:40:\"bigstock-digital-background-40580767.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:64:\"public://article-images/bigstock-digital-background-40580767.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"346186\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371337433\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1411382993,1),('field:node:110','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:514:\"Mark is rapidly making his name on the UK comedy circuit scooping numerous awards and competition accolades. Constantly evolving, usually unpredictable; he garners positive reactions everywhere he goes.  Mark has supported the likes of Gary Delaney, Shazia Mirza, Nick Helm and Isy Suttie and has appeared at the Edinburgh Festival several times. He has appeared at other festivals up and down the country including the Newquay Relentless Boardmasters Festival, Spotlight at Milton Keynes and Rhythms of The World.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:514:\"Mark is rapidly making his name on the UK comedy circuit scooping numerous awards and competition accolades. Constantly evolving, usually unpredictable; he garners positive reactions everywhere he goes.  Mark has supported the likes of Gary Delaney, Shazia Mirza, Nick Helm and Isy Suttie and has appeared at the Edinburgh Festival several times. He has appeared at other festivals up and down the country including the Newquay Relentless Boardmasters Festival, Spotlight at Milton Keynes and Rhythms of The World.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"65\";s:3:\"alt\";s:28:\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"750\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"Mark-Cram.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"59909\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1375561537\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222147,1),('field:node:111','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411240223,1),('field:node:114','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:461:\"<p>A full-time comic since 2010, John is another act bringing to Danny’s Comedy Club a wealth of experience and a great pedigree.</p>\r\n<p>He has performed in ten countries and at 33 cities in the USA including the famous New York Comedy Club.</p>\r\n<p>He is an Edinburgh Festival regular, where he was a semi-finalist at the So You Think You’re Funny Awards in 2011 as well as a semi-finalist at the Leicester Square New Act of the Year in 2012 and 2013.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:459:\"<p>A full-time comic since 2010, John is another act bringing to Danny’s Comedy Club a wealth of experience and a great pedigree.</p>\n<p>He has performed in ten countries and at 33 cities in the USA including the famous New York Comedy Club.</p>\n<p>He is an Edinburgh Festival regular, where he was a semi-finalist at the So You Think You’re Funny Awards in 2011 as well as a semi-finalist at the Leicester Square New Act of the Year in 2012 and 2013.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"66\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"551\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"800\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"John-Pendal.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/John-Pendal.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"91206\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1375561773\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:3:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"237\";}i:1;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"238\";}i:2;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"236\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"188\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"John Pendal\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"John Pendal\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"424\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"John-Pendal-2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:50:\"public://artistes-multiple-image/John-Pendal-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"64008\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401571762\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1414230399,1),('field:node:115','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411240223,1),('field:node:119','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:672:\"Eddie Twist was raised on a small farm in Cornwall where he was, to borrow a phrase, the only Goth in the village. Now as an adult, Eddie Twist has found his natural home on the comedy circuit where his unique background and outlook give his comedy a unique and colourful perspective that connects with anyone who\'s ever felt they never quite belonged. Energetic, captivating and hilarious, Eddie is making his name regularly performing at clubs nationwide and abroad. He appeared onstage at the O2 with Lee Evans during his Big tour and has appeared on television, most notably on Russell Howard’s Good News and playing rock star Bono on BBC’s John Bishop\'s Britain. \";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:672:\"Eddie Twist was raised on a small farm in Cornwall where he was, to borrow a phrase, the only Goth in the village. Now as an adult, Eddie Twist has found his natural home on the comedy circuit where his unique background and outlook give his comedy a unique and colourful perspective that connects with anyone who\'s ever felt they never quite belonged. Energetic, captivating and hilarious, Eddie is making his name regularly performing at clubs nationwide and abroad. He appeared onstage at the O2 with Lee Evans during his Big tour and has appeared on television, most notably on Russell Howard’s Good News and playing rock star Bono on BBC’s John Bishop\'s Britain. \";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"67\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Eddie Twist, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Eddie Twist, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"1268\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"1448\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Eddie-Twist.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Eddie-Twist.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"463936\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1375562030\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222147,1),('field:node:12','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:416:\"Danny\'s Comedy Club offers comedy and other entertainment for the over 18\'s. Please be aware that much of the material will be adult in nature and those easily offended should stay at home with a mug of cocoa.\r\n\r\nDanny’s is different from other comedy clubs in offering wider forms of entertainment than purely stand-up; singers, ventriloquists, and many others help to form a more rounded night’s entertainment.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:438:\"<p>Danny&#039;s Comedy Club offers comedy and other entertainment for the over 18&#039;s. Please be aware that much of the material will be adult in nature and those easily offended should stay at home with a mug of cocoa.</p>\n<p>Danny’s is different from other comedy clubs in offering wider forms of entertainment than purely stand-up; singers, ventriloquists, and many others help to form a more rounded night’s entertainment.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"15\";s:3:\"alt\";s:28:\"Wider forms of Entertainment\";s:5:\"title\";s:18:\"Entertainment Icon\";s:5:\"width\";s:2:\"40\";s:6:\"height\";s:2:\"40\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:22:\"1360291293_6_40x40.png\";s:3:\"uri\";s:45:\"public://article-image/1360291293_6_40x40.png\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:4:\"3483\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371337767\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"16\";s:3:\"alt\";s:39:\"Our Shows: Wider forms of Entertainment\";s:5:\"title\";s:39:\"Our Shows: Wider forms of Entertainment\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"900\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"600\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:32:\"bigstock-Warm-Smiles-7829189.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:56:\"public://article-images/bigstock-Warm-Smiles-7829189.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"413447\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371337767\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1411325556,1),('field:node:120','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411240223,1),('field:node:124','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1532:\"<p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adrienne Coles lived for many years in Forest Row, and is returning to Haywards Heath on the 30th of August. Both her children were born in the Princess Royal Hospital, and further to her divorce in 2010 they moved to Bournemouth, where they are all settled and happy.  It was at this point in her life that she was able to follow her dream of being a stand up comedian, and in the short time she has been on the circuit she has taken it by storm. ‘It is what I was destined for and I am having the best time of my life’. Its the biggest thrill of all to write, and perform material that makes people laugh’.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adrienne’s original observational material is full of clever word play, strong characterisation and she draws on her many life experiences past and present. Her apparent innocence is soon betrayed by an obvious wicked streak, and herein lies her appeal.  Her set includes audience interaction, and gentle put downs that get great laughs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already having started her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where she is MC and has appeared on the bill alongside Sol Bernstein, and for the military with Drew Cameron.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:1525:\"<p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent. </p>\n\n<p>Adrienne Coles lived for many years in Forest Row, and is returning to Haywards Heath on the 30th of August. Both her children were born in the Princess Royal Hospital, and further to her divorce in 2010 they moved to Bournemouth, where they are all settled and happy.  It was at this point in her life that she was able to follow her dream of being a stand up comedian, and in the short time she has been on the circuit she has taken it by storm. ‘It is what I was destined for and I am having the best time of my life’. Its the biggest thrill of all to write, and perform material that makes people laugh’.</p>\n\n<p>Adrienne’s original observational material is full of clever word play, strong characterisation and she draws on her many life experiences past and present. Her apparent innocence is soon betrayed by an obvious wicked streak, and herein lies her appeal.  Her set includes audience interaction, and gentle put downs that get great laughs.</p>\n\n<p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already having started her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where she is MC and has appeared on the bill alongside Sol Bernstein, and for the military with Drew Cameron.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"68\";s:3:\"alt\";s:33:\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"720\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"576\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Adrienne-Coles.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"274464\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1375562415\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222147,1),('field:node:125','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411240223,1),('field:node:129','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:592:\"Local girl Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events.  She has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show. A multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. She is very much looking forward to performing at Danny’s Comedy Club.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:592:\"Local girl Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events.  She has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show. A multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. She is very much looking forward to performing at Danny’s Comedy Club.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"69\";s:3:\"alt\";s:20:\"Tania Rodd, Musician\";s:5:\"title\";s:20:\"Tania Rodd, Musician\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"202\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"250\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Tania-Rodd.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:4:\"7226\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"times