h in demand with clubs across London and the UK. Her confidence on stage and the complexity in her routine yield a performance beyond her experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bath New Act 2012 - Finalist</p>\r\n<p>Cavendish Arms \'Not Going to the Fringe\' Summer Competition - Finalist</p>\r\n<p>Funny Women - Semi-Finalist</p>\r\n<p>Golden Jester - Semi-Finalist</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:536:\"<p>Robyn draws on her life as an American in the UK to compare cultural differences and to share stories of debauchery. </p>\n<p>Since she started in the business two years ago Robyn has become much in demand with clubs across London and the UK. Her confidence on stage and the complexity in her routine yield a performance beyond her experience.</p>\n\n<p>Bath New Act 2012 - Finalist</p>\n<p>Cavendish Arms \'Not Going to the Fringe\' Summer Competition - Finalist</p>\n<p>Funny Women - Semi-Finalist</p>\n<p>Golden Jester - Semi-Finalist</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"113\";s:3:\"alt\";s:32:\"Robyn Perkins, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:32:\"Robyn Perkins, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"460\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Robyn-Perkins.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Robyn-Perkins.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"118779\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380614294\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"21\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411217966,1),('field:node:176','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411265570,1),('field:node:177','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:478:\"<p>Award-winning comic Jo has been performing for three years now and runs her own Club Jolly Comedy in Worthing. She recently made the semi-finals of Funny Women. </p>\r\n<p>Her likeable, self-deprecating personality instantly comes across with a fun and energetic delivery, lightly seasoned with hints of sarcasm. </p>\r\n<p>An impressive stage presence and great comic timing, coupled with an array of excellent comedy voices and spot on accents make her performances shine. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:476:\"<p>Award-winning comic Jo has been performing for three years now and runs her own Club Jolly Comedy in Worthing. She recently made the semi-finals of Funny Women. </p>\n<p>Her likeable, self-deprecating personality instantly comes across with a fun and energetic delivery, lightly seasoned with hints of sarcasm. </p>\n<p>An impressive stage presence and great comic timing, coupled with an array of excellent comedy voices and spot on accents make her performances shine. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"114\";s:3:\"alt\";s:28:\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"415\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"Jo-Public.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:37:\"public://artistes-image/Jo-Public.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"35248\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380751494\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:18','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411269880,1),('field:node:180','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216531,1),('field:node:181','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:133:\"Warm, upbeat and much in demand with comedy clubs across the country, Midlands based Mickey will be coming to the show by camper van.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:133:\"Warm, upbeat and much in demand with comedy clubs across the country, Midlands based Mickey will be coming to the show by camper van.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"115\";s:3:\"alt\";s:32:\"Mickey Nutall, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:32:\"Mickey Nutall, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"453\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"604\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Mickey-Nuttall.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Mickey-Nuttall.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"56504\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380751730\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216531,1),('field:node:182','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222143,1),('field:node:184','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:424:\"<p>West country comedian, actress and writer Laura Lexx is a uniquely gleeful performer who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. </p>\r\n<p>After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the finals of both the Chortle and Paramount student competitions in her first year, Laura has since been a popular act at clubs across the UK and a regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:423:\"<p>West country comedian, actress and writer Laura Lexx is a uniquely gleeful performer who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. </p>\n<p>After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the finals of both the Chortle and Paramount student competitions in her first year, Laura has since been a popular act at clubs across the UK and a regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"116\";s:3:\"alt\";s:29:\"Laura Lexx, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Laura Lexx, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"451\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Laura-Lexx.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Laura-Lexx.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"69674\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380752249\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"22\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:185','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222143,1),('field:node:188','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1117:\"<p>Gavin may be most known to you as the voice on bbc three and discovery, but he’s also presented for big broadcasters such as mtv, channel 4 and five along with more recently high profile online shows with the independent online, britain’s got talent and o2.his embroiled with the medium that he loves and his route to broadcasting is from radio and production, his experience his extensive and invaluable. it’s been a fun journey so there’s no better place to start than, the beginning……</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A talented comedian, broadcaster and writer for radio and television, he’s been a presenter for Channel Four, T4 and as an announcer on BBC3, Discovery Channel, Channel Five, MTV and Dave. He was involved at the inception of CBBC and has presented shows on Galaxy, BBC Radio 7, BFBS and Capital Radio including Live 8. He has worked as a studio warm-up comedian and has supported top stars like Russell Kane and Jon Culshaw. He’s done voiceovers for TV shows as diverse as Lee Nelson’s Well Funny People and BBC Crimewatch.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Gavin’s pet dog Holly was cousin to Rolly in Eastenders.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:1112:\"<p>Gavin may be most known to you as the voice on bbc three and discovery, but he’s also presented for big broadcasters such as mtv, channel 4 and five along with more recently high profile online shows with the independent online, britain’s got talent and o2.his embroiled with the medium that he loves and his route to broadcasting is from radio and production, his experience his extensive and invaluable. it’s been a fun journey so there’s no better place to start than, the beginning……</p>\n\n<p>A talented comedian, broadcaster and writer for radio and television, he’s been a presenter for Channel Four, T4 and as an announcer on BBC3, Discovery Channel, Channel Five, MTV and Dave. He was involved at the inception of CBBC and has presented shows on Galaxy, BBC Radio 7, BFBS and Capital Radio including Live 8. He has worked as a studio warm-up comedian and has supported top stars like Russell Kane and Jon Culshaw. He’s done voiceovers for TV shows as diverse as Lee Nelson’s Well Funny People and BBC Crimewatch.</p>\n\n<p>Gavin’s pet dog Holly was cousin to Rolly in Eastenders.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"117\";s:3:\"alt\";s:31:\"Gavin Inskip, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"Gavin Inskip, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"800\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"1200\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Gavin-Inskip.png\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Gavin-Inskip.png\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"165251\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380752510\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,141121653