cene with a fresh new act you’ll love.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:187:\"Cheerful, warm, upbeat... she\'s not.  Louise looks at life when it doesn’t turn out as expected. She’s a rising talent on the regional comedy scene with a fresh new act you’ll love.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"119\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Louise Dean, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Louise Dean, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"136\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"166\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Louise-Dean.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Louise-Dean.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:4:\"4164\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380753034\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216531,1),('field:node:197','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222143,1),('field:node:198','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:438:\"<p>Brighton-based ex-Surrey boy, John is a seasoned amateur, whose natural strengths seem to lie in his adaptability and inventiveness. As well as being an avid home-recorder, his vocal and guitar live performances usually involve some elaborately descriptive and often comedic asides. </p>\r\n<p>John has been in demand across London and the south-east as well as further afield. He enjoys being offered and taking-on fresh challenges.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:437:\"<p>Brighton-based ex-Surrey boy, John is a seasoned amateur, whose natural strengths seem to lie in his adaptability and inventiveness. As well as being an avid home-recorder, his vocal and guitar live performances usually involve some elaborately descriptive and often comedic asides. </p>\n<p>John has been in demand across London and the south-east as well as further afield. He enjoys being offered and taking-on fresh challenges.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"120\";s:3:\"alt\";s:28:\"John Zonn, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"John Zonn, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"337\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"488\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"John-Zonn.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:37:\"public://artistes-image/John-Zonn.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"157066\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380753165\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216531,1),('field:node:199','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222143,1),('field:node:2','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:331:\"Superb, Brighton-based comic from Dublin, after four years gigging on the professional stand up circuit and his first successful Edinburgh fringe 2011 one man solo show, Recovering Catholics Anonymous (and other crosses I\'ve had to bear) JW is acquiring a well-deserved reputation as a top quality and highly entertaining comedian.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:344:\"<p>Superb, Brighton-based comic from Dublin, after four years gigging on the professional stand up circuit and his first successful Edinburgh fringe 2011 one man solo show, Recovering Catholics Anonymous (and other crosses I&#039;ve had to bear) JW is acquiring a well-deserved reputation as a top quality and highly entertaining comedian.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:1:\"1\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"276\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"343\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:21:\"Jonwayne-Connolly.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:45:\"public://artistes-image/Jonwayne-Connolly.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"29710\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371332680\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411217260,1),('field:node:20','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411217260,1),('field:node:201','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:548:\"<p>Highly recommended by other Club owners, “performance poet and light entertainer” (yes, really!) Malcolm has won awards and stuff. He supported celebrity comedian Paul Foot on national tours in 2011 and 2012, and has performed at most of the nation’s top comedy venues. </p>\r\n<p>Malcolm is the creation of writer Jack Stratten, who has written sketches for BBC radio shows including BBC7\'s Newsjack and has written for singer Geri Halliwell. Jack’s latest sketches are currently being screened on Channel 4\'s hilarious I\'m Spazticus.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:547:\"<p>Highly recommended by other Club owners, “performance poet and light entertainer” (yes, really!) Malcolm has won awards and stuff. He supported celebrity comedian Paul Foot on national tours in 2011 and 2012, and has performed at most of the nation’s top comedy venues. </p>\n<p>Malcolm is the creation of writer Jack Stratten, who has written sketches for BBC radio shows including BBC7\'s Newsjack and has written for singer Geri Halliwell. Jack’s latest sketches are currently being screened on Channel 4\'s hilarious I\'m Spazticus.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"121\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Malcom Head, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Malcom Head, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"300\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Malcolm-Head.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Malcolm-Head.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"11445\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380754196\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:202','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411241012,1),('field:node:206','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:643:\"<p>We are thrilled to welcome the phenomenally talented comedian, musician, writer and broadcaster Rosie Wilby. As a comedian, she has performed at Sydney Mardi Gras, The Comedy Store, Latitude Festival and on Radio 4.  As a musician she has performed at the Glastonbury Festival, Ronnie Scotts and on Carlton TV. </p>\r\n<p>Rosie first tried stand up comedy in 2004 after encouragement from fans at music gigs who enjoyed her between song banter. Her CV now reads like a who’s who of the country’s top comedy venues. She also comperes and curates Femmes by the Thames at Royal Vauxhall Tavern and has appeared on Radio 4’s Loose Ends.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:642:\"<p>We are thrilled to welcome the phenomenally talented comedian, musician, writer and broadcaster Rosie Wilby. As a comedian, she has performed at Sydney Mardi Gras, The Comedy Store, Latitude Festival and on Radio 4.  As a musician she has performed at the Glastonbury Festival, Ronnie Scotts and on Carlton TV. </p>\n<p>Rosie first tried stand up comedy in 2004 after encouragement from fans at music gigs who enjoyed her between song banter. Her CV now reads like a who’s who of the country’s top comedy venues. She also comperes and curates Femmes by the Thames at Royal Vauxhall Tavern and has appeared on Radio 4’s Loose Ends.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"122\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Rosie Wilby, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Rosie Wilby, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"430\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"477\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Rosie-Wilby.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Rosie-Wilby.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"72098\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380754711\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:21','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"50\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Danny Kington\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Danny Kington\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"1064\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"1606\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:31:\"Show-Highlights-31-may-2013.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:52:\"public://shows-image/Show-Highlights-31-may-2013.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:7:\"1380726\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371496600\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1412201236,1),('field:node:210','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:211','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:432:\"<p>A highly talented stand-up, radio presenter, comedy writer and reformed northerner, Steve has lots to says and finds a nice way to say it. From relatable anecdotes to topical commentary, Steve uses his material to build a strong rapport with audiences. </p>\r\n<p>With a total sell-out show at the Edinburgh Fringe, he has performed at many of the UK’s best Clubs, including the Comedy Store and the Leicester Square Theatre.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:431:\"<p>A highly talented stand-up, radio presenter, comedy writer and reformed northerner, Steve has lots to says and finds a nice way to say it. From relatable anecdotes to topical commentary, Steve uses his material to build a strong rapport with audiences. </p>\n<p>With a total sell-out show at the Edinburgh Fringe, he has performed at many of the UK’s best Clubs, including the Comedy Store and the Leicester Square Theatre.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"123\";s:3:\"alt\";s:32:\"Steve N Allen, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:32:\"Steve N Allen, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"200\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"385\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Steve-N-Allen.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Steve-N-Allen.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"56316\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380754966\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:214','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411269022,1),('field:node:215','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:527:\"<p>A peculiar combination of camp butchness, Danny Hurst is probably the only orthodox Jewish, bisexual, left-handed, vegetarian Manchester City fan on the circuit. A highly experienced and talented performer of comedy, performance art, theatre, circus and telesales.</p>\r\n<p>Once a professional stilt-walker and fire eater, he toured with the top ten band Dodgy in 1996 and has performed all over the UK, as well as recent tours of Japan and the South of France, Amsterdam and Barcelona. A truly international performer.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:525:\"<p>A peculiar combination of camp butchness, Danny Hurst is probably the only orthodox Jewish, bisexual, left-handed, vegetarian Manchester City fan on the circuit. A highly experienced and talented performer of comedy, performance art, theatre, circus and telesales.</p>\n<p>Once a professional stilt-walker and fire eater, he toured with the top ten band Dodgy in 1996 and has performed all over the UK, as well as recent tours of Japan and the South of France, Amsterdam and Barcelona. A truly international performer.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"124\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Danny Hurst, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Danny Hurst, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"382\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Danny-Hurst.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Danny-Hurst.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"30982\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380755327\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:216','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411328790,1),('field:node:22','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:669:\"<p>Vice President of the Cambridge Footlights, sold out at the Edinburgh Fringe and Chortle Comedy Awards finalist 2012.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Coming to us direct from the Isle of Man, Cambridge Footlights Vice-President, Pierre Novellie enjoyed huge success with his sell-out Edinburgh show in 2012 and was a finalist at last year’s Chortle! Comedy Awards. </p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clearfix column_normal\">\r\n<div class=\"column_title\">\r\n<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\"><h4>PIERRE NOVELLIE at the Chortle Comedy Awards</h4></a>\r\n</div>\r\n<iframe width=\"420\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:663:\"<p>Vice President of the Cambridge Footlights, sold out at the Edinburgh Fringe and Chortle Comedy Awards finalist 2012.</p>\n\n<p>Coming to us direct from the Isle of Man, Cambridge Footlights Vice-President, Pierre Novellie enjoyed huge success with his sell-out Edinburgh show in 2012 and was a finalist at last year’s Chortle! Comedy Awards. </p>\n\n<div class=\"clearfix column_normal\">\n<div class=\"column_title\">\n<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\"><h4>PIERRE NOVELLIE at the Chortle Comedy Awards</h4></a>\n</div>\n<iframe width=\"420\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n</div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"17\";s:3:\"alt\";s:34:\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:34:\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"400\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"600\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:27:\"Pierre-Novellie-400x600.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:51:\"public://artistes-image/Pierre-Novellie-400x600.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"95881\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371381035\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:1:\"1\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1413366854,1),('field:node:220','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:376:\"<p>In just eighteen months Sarah has performed all over the UK and in California, racking up 150 gigs and reaching the semi-finals of Funny Women in 2012. </p>\r\n<p>Combining quirky tunes with sharp gags, Sarah is resident comedian at Studio 58 in London and is a regular at other top comedy venues in the capital. She is also a TV comedy producer, working for ITV and STV.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:375:\"<p>In just eighteen months Sarah has performed all over the UK and in California, racking up 150 gigs and reaching the semi-finals of Funny Women in 2012. </p>\n<p>Combining quirky tunes with sharp gags, Sarah is resident comedian at Studio 58 in London and is a regular at other top comedy venues in the capital. She is also a TV comedy producer, working for ITV and STV.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"125\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Sarah Mills, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Sarah Mills, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"198\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"321\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Sarah-Mills.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Sarah-Mills.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"11114\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380755577\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411218832,1),('field:node:221','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411275753,1),('field:node:223','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:319:\"<p>A consummate performer who comes to us highly recommended, Stu Turner blends comedy and magic with absolute nonsense. </p>\r\n<p>His offbeat act is intelligent, sometimes surreal... but always baffling and highly entertaining. No cheesy ladies in sparkly leotards, no cute animals, and certainly no shiny bow ties.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:318:\"<p>A consummate performer who comes to us highly recommended, Stu Turner blends comedy and magic with absolute nonsense. </p>\n<p>His offbeat act is intelligent, sometimes surreal... but always baffling and highly entertaining. No cheesy ladies in sparkly leotards, no cute animals, and certainly no shiny bow ties.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"126\";s:3:\"alt\";s:29:\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"265\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"340\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Stu-Turner.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Stu-Turner.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"15765\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1380755744\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:224','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411268963,1),('field:node:228','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:265:\"<p>Local girl Jess has been in much demand on the regional scene since auditioning successfully for BBC’s The Voice. </p>\r\n<p>She had the distinction of opening our very first comedy show and we are thrilled to have her back to delight and entertain us again!</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:264:\"<p>Local girl Jess has been in much demand on the regional scene since auditioning successfully for BBC’s The Voice. </p>\n<p>She had the distinction of opening our very first comedy show and we are thrilled to have her back to delight and entertain us again!</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411271675,1),('field:node:229','a:0:{}',0,1411316341,1),('field:node:23','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:214:\"Well known and popular veteran of over a hundred gigs, serial entrepreneur Dave is also the brains behind a unique venture laying on bespoke ‘paparazzi’  for private parties and events, at the hosts’ request.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:222:\"<p>Well known and popular veteran of over a hundred gigs, serial entrepreneur Dave is also the brains behind a unique venture laying on bespoke ‘paparazzi’  for private parties and events, at the hosts’ request.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"18\";s:3:\"alt\";s:32:\"Dave Streeter, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:32:\"Dave Streeter, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"389\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"412\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Dave-Streeter.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Dave-Streeter.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"58751\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371382191\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222898,1),('field:node:230','a:0:{}',0,1411316341,1),('field:node:231','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:184:\"An Absurdist one liner with punch lines that come from every direction. A semi-finalist in So You Think You\'re Funny in 2011 and a semi-finalist in the Golden Jester Competition 2012. \";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:184:\"An Absurdist one liner with punch lines that come from every direction. A semi-finalist in So You Think You\'re Funny in 2011 and a semi-finalist in the Golden Jester Competition 2012. \";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"129\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"2448\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"3264\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Tommy-Barnes.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Tommy-Barnes.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"485954\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\"