h show this year, Dave Bailey &amp; Friends Comedy Hour.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"130\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Dave Bailey\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Dave Bailey\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"451\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Dave-Bailey.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Dave-Bailey.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"42642\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390747145\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411307671,1),('field:node:235','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:236','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:237','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:238','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:239','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:24','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1990:\"<p>A Graduate of the National Youth Theatre, this hugely talented and versatile comedian, actress, singer and musician has appeared regularly on TV, has her own show Get Carter playing live comedy gigs to audiences of more than a thousand.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"white\">\r\n<div class=\"column\"<p>Joy Carter (<a href=\"http://joycarter.co.uk\">http://joycarter.co.uk</a>) is an EMMA award (*Ethnic multicultural media award) nominated musical stand up comedian. She has also appeared in successful shows such as ‘The Job Lot’ ITV as well as appearing on countless TV and radio news reviews and broadcasts, most recently for Channel 4 News ‘WT4’, SKY and BBC Breakfast.   Joy is an established full time comedian who started off life with the National Youth Theatre of Great Britain where she discovered her love of comedy. </p></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"column\"><p>Expect a fast paced, intelligent and quirky performance leaving you refreshed and full of joy! </p></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"column\">Work includes: <label class=\"label label-info\">Funny Women</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Voodoo Lounge</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Alexander’s (Chester)</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Buzz Comedy Clubs</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Laughing Bag</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Side Splitters Comedy</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Funhouse Comedy Clubs</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Leicester Comedy Festival</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">The Comedy Café</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">East Dulwich Tavern</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Big Cheese Comedy Clubs</label>, plus many more…</p></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"column\"><p>Joy is also a campaigner on adoption issues, using her own story as inspiration for some of her act, and has set up company <a href=\"http://adoptionarena.com\">http://adoptionarena.com</a> to campaign on adoption issues and produce comedy adoption events.</p></div></div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:1971:\"<p>A Graduate of the National Youth Theatre, this hugely talented and versatile comedian, actress, singer and musician has appeared regularly on TV, has her own show Get Carter playing live comedy gigs to audiences of more than a thousand.</p>\n\n<div class=\"white\">\n<div class=\"column\">Joy Carter (<a href=\"http://joycarter.co.uk\">http://joycarter.co.uk</a>) is an EMMA award (*Ethnic multicultural media award) nominated musical stand up comedian. She has also appeared in successful shows such as ‘The Job Lot’ ITV as well as appearing on countless TV and radio news reviews and broadcasts, most recently for Channel 4 News ‘WT4’, SKY and BBC Breakfast.   Joy is an established full time comedian who started off life with the National Youth Theatre of Great Britain where she discovered her love of comedy. </div>\n\n<div class=\"column\"><p>Expect a fast paced, intelligent and quirky performance leaving you refreshed and full of joy! </p></div>\n\n<div class=\"column\">Work includes: <label class=\"label label-info\">Funny Women</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Voodoo Lounge</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Alexander’s (Chester)</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Buzz Comedy Clubs</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Laughing Bag</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Side Splitters Comedy</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Funhouse Comedy Clubs</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Leicester Comedy Festival</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">The Comedy Café</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">East Dulwich Tavern</label>, <label class=\"label label-info\">Big Cheese Comedy Clubs</label>, plus many more…</div>\n\n<div class=\"column\"><p>Joy is also a campaigner on adoption issues, using her own story as inspiration for some of her act, and has set up company <a href=\"http://adoptionarena.com\">http://adoptionarena.com</a> to campaign on adoption issues and produce comedy adoption events.</p></div></div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"203\";s:3:\"alt\";s:10:\"Joy Carter\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Joy Carter\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"285\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"240\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Joy-Carter-2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Joy-Carter-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"31071\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1406228869\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:no