7:\"Eva is a singer, based in Burgess Hill, Sussex and lead singer of a popular local band.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:87:\"Eva is a singer, based in Burgess Hill, Sussex and lead singer of a popular local band.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"135\";s:3:\"alt\";s:15:\"Eva Vidal Oriol\";s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Eva Vidal Oriol\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"225\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"225\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:19:\"Eva-Vidal-Oriol.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:43:\"public://artistes-image/Eva-Vidal-Oriol.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:4:\"8195\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390767980\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215605,1),('field:node:255','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411245957,1),('field:node:256','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:687:\"<p>Whilst still relatively fresh on the Comedy scene, Londoner Mark Diamond has established a reputation for himself as an excellent observational comic and crowd favourite. His eloquent delivery, laid back ease and charisma are the perfect compliments to his sharp wit. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mark made his Edinburgh Festival debut in 2012 with comedy partner Darren Walsh, in their acclaimed show Six Foot Silly. The show became a word of mouth hit and received excellent reviews. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Mark has also performed at major UK festivals and comedy venues around the country, sharing the bill with circuit legends including Tony Law, Danny Bhoy, Lee Nelson and Norman Lovett to name but a few.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:683:\"<p>Whilst still relatively fresh on the Comedy scene, Londoner Mark Diamond has established a reputation for himself as an excellent observational comic and crowd favourite. His eloquent delivery, laid back ease and charisma are the perfect compliments to his sharp wit. </p>\n\n<p>Mark made his Edinburgh Festival debut in 2012 with comedy partner Darren Walsh, in their acclaimed show Six Foot Silly. The show became a word of mouth hit and received excellent reviews. </p>\n\n<p>Mark has also performed at major UK festivals and comedy venues around the country, sharing the bill with circuit legends including Tony Law, Danny Bhoy, Lee Nelson and Norman Lovett to name but a few.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"136\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Mark Diamond\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Mark Diamond\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"400\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"821\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Mark-Diamond.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Mark-Diamond.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"180266\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390768320\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215605,1),('field:node:257','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411311209,1),('field:node:258','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:138:\"Brighton-based Josh is an up-and-coming new talent on the local comedy scene delivering wry observational comedy with a dark take on life.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:138:\"Brighton-based Josh is an up-and-coming new talent on the local comedy scene delivering wry observational comedy with a dark take on life.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"137\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Josh Dillon\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Josh Dillon\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"599\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"599\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Josh-Dillon.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Josh-Dillon.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"219519\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390768733\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215605,1),('field:node:259','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411293135,1),('field:node:26','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:591:\"“Wandering ponderer” Michael Mooney is from Glasgow but has been living in Brighton for the last nine years. He is a regular on the thriving Brighton stand-up comedy scene and in 2012, he performed his first Edinburgh Fringe compilation show entitled Can You Put This In The Bin For Me? which was a sell out on a daily basis. \r\n\r\nHis competition credits include: Leicester Square New Comedian of the Year Finalist (2010) and So You Think You\'re Funny Semi-Finalist (2011). A natural and likeable comedian, yet a bit crazy and off the wall, he is on the rise and well worth catching now. \";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:607:\"<p>“Wandering ponderer” Michael Mooney is from Glasgow but has been living in Brighton for the last nine years. He is a regular on the thriving Brighton stand-up comedy scene and in 2012, he performed his first Edinburgh Fringe compilation show entitled Can You Put This In The Bin For Me? which was a sell out on a daily basis. </p>\n<p>His competition credits include: Leicester Square New Comedian of the Year Finalist (2010) and So You Think You&#039;re Funny Semi-Finalist (2011). A natural and likeable comedian, yet a bit crazy and off the wall, he is on the rise and well worth catching now.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"21\";s:3:\"alt\";s:33:\"Michael Mooney, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:33:\"Michael Mooney, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"524\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"609\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Michael-Mooney.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Michael-Mooney.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"83559\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371382585\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411222898,1),('field:node:260','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"138\";s:3:\"alt\";s:9:\"Mat Ewins\";s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Mat Ewins\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"156\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"253\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"Mat-Ewins.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:37:\"public://artistes-image/Mat-Ewins.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"18211\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390770537\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411219430,1),('field:node:261','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:456:\"<p>By courtesy of PBJ Management, we are proud to welcome up and coming headliner Mat. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>On only his 382nd gig and well before his fourth consecutive year of performing stand-up comedy, Mat Ewins won the Saltford heat of the North Somerset New Act Competition Sal Monello\'s Comedy Gladiators. From September onwards, Mat Ewins can be found regularly opening Gladiator weekends, doing corporates for centurions and auditioning for toga adverts.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:454:\"<p>By courtesy of PBJ Management, we are proud to welcome up and coming headliner Mat. </p>\n\n<p>On only his 382nd gig and well before his fourth consecutive year of performing stand-up comedy, Mat Ewins won the Saltford heat of the North Somerset New Act Competition Sal Monello\'s Comedy Gladiators. From September onwards, Mat Ewins can be found regularly opening Gladiator weekends, doing corporates for centurions and auditioning for toga adverts.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411243997,1),('field:node:262','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:606:\"<p>London-based David is in constant demand from clubs right across the country. An experienced and intelligent comedian, his act has a broad range of comedy including storytelling, punchy one-liners, ad-libbed routines and relaxed crowd interaction. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Incredibly, David won both King Gong at London’s famous Comedy Store AND Comedy Cafe\'s competition in the same week this June. He has also beaten the gong at the Comedy Store in Manchester, was in the semi-final of the Leicester Square New Comedian of the Year competition in 2011 and was an Olympia New Comedy Act Finalist the same year.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:604:\"<p>London-based David is in constant demand from clubs right across the country. An experienced and intelligent comedian, his act has a broad range of comedy including storytelling, punchy one-liners, ad-libbed routines and relaxed crowd interaction. </p>\n\n<p>Incredibly, David won both King Gong at London’s famous Comedy Store AND Comedy Cafe\'s competition in the same week this June. He has also beaten the gong at the Comedy Store in Manchester, was in the semi-final of the Leicester Square New Comedian of the Year competition in 2011 and was an Olympia New Comedy Act Finalist the same year.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"139\";s:3:\"alt\";s:15:\"David Jesudason\";s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"David Jesudason\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"400\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"482\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:19:\"David-Jesudason.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:43:\"public://artistes-image/David-Jesudason.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"44106\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390770973\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411219430,1),('field:node:263','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1034:\"<h4 class=\"column_title\">Nigel Lovell (The Man In The Bowler Hat)</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Stand-up comedian, writer and promoter, Nigel started his comedy career in 2010 under the name The Man in the Bowler Hat and instantly loved it. He’s been gigging ever since, travelling the length and breadth of Britain making audiences laugh.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Now a regular MC for comedy nights and spots for Oi Oi Comedy, Mirth Control and Laughing Horse amongst others. He was a finalist in the 2012 Newbury Comedy Festival’s You Must Be Joking Competition, and has won the Ipswich Big Comedy Cheese competition. Confident and relaxed on stage, he has appeared alongside none other than Alan Davies, Steve Day, Peter Tennant, and Dan Wright as well as many others.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You may already have seen Nigel when he was the subject of the double award winning documentary on stand up comedians, The Routine.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He is a regular contributor to NewsRevue (The world’s longest running live comedy show), The Treason Show and BBC Radio’s NewsJack. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:1026:\"<h4 class=\"column_title\">Nigel Lovell (The Man In The Bowler Hat)</h4>\n\n<p>Stand-up comedian, writer and promoter, Nigel started his comedy career in 2010 under the name The Man in the Bowler Hat and instantly loved it. He’s been gigging ever since, travelling the length and breadth of Britain making audiences laugh.</p>\n\n<p>Now a regular MC for comedy nights and spots for Oi Oi Comedy, Mirth Control and Laughing Horse amongst others. He was a finalist in the 2012 Newbury Comedy Festival’s You Must Be Joking Competition, and has won the Ipswich Big Comedy Cheese competition. Confident and relaxed on stage, he has appeared alongside none other than Alan Davies, Steve Day, Peter Tennant, and Dan Wright as well as many others.</p>\n\n<p>You may already have seen Nigel when he was the subject of the double award winning documentary on stand up comedians, The Routine.</p>\n\n<p>He is a regular contributor to NewsRevue (The world’s longest running live comedy show), The Treason Show and BBC Radio’s NewsJack. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"140\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Nigel Lovell \";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Nigel Lovell \";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"720\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"501\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Nigel-Lovell.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Nigel-Lovell.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"54339\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390771324\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:264','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:434:\"<p>Robin likes to call it Surreal LITE. Throw in some topical gags and some slightly skewed observations on life, mix with some longer autobiographical stuff. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Very, very laid and relaxed on stage back. With the name of an ice skater and the looks of Hugh Fearnly-Whittingstall\'s long lost brother, Robin Cousins is one of the least threatening comedians we\'ve seen in a long time.  Wait until you see his dalek routine!</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:432:\"<p>Robin likes to call it Surreal LITE. Throw in some topical gags and some slightly skewed observations on life, mix with some longer autobiographical stuff. </p>\n\n<p>Very, very laid and relaxed on stage back. With the name of an ice skater and the looks of Hugh Fearnly-Whittingstall\'s long lost brother, Robin Cousins is one of the least threatening comedians we\'ve seen in a long time.  Wait until you see his dalek routine!</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"141\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Robin Cousins\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Robin Cousins\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"400\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"680\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Robin-Cousins.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Robin-Cousins.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"109101\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390771492\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411219430,1),('field:node:265','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:192:\"Burgess Hill-based Natalie is an absolute singing sensation!  Her stunning voice regularly transfixes audiences wherever she performs and we confidently expect to see her on TV in due course.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:192:\"Burgess Hill-based Natalie is an absolute singing sensation!  Her stunning voice regularly transfixes audiences wherever she performs and we confidently expect to see her on TV in due course.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"143\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Natalie Howe\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Natalie Howe\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"640\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"812\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Natalie-Howe.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Natalie-Howe.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"127150\";s:6:\"status\"