cuit. She shot to acclaim as a finalist at the Chortle Student Comedy Awards in 2012, just three months after staring out as a comedian.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dalia has since appeared at the Edinburgh Fringe Festival and at comedy Clubs in the United States, Ireland and in Egypt.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:410:\"<p>An Egyptian-Californian who started in London, Dalia’s brand of dark, irreverent humour has helped her rapid progress on the comedy circuit. She shot to acclaim as a finalist at the Chortle Student Comedy Awards in 2012, just three months after staring out as a comedian.</p>\n\n<p>Dalia has since appeared at the Edinburgh Fringe Festival and at comedy Clubs in the United States, Ireland and in Egypt.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"144\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Dalia Malek\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Dalia Malek\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"709\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Dalia-Malek.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Dalia-Malek.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"50133\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1390942244\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411219430,1),('field:node:272','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411327385,1),('field:node:273','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"154\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Louise Reay\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Louise Reay\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"240\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"240\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Louise-Reay.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Louise-Reay.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"12302\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1391281206\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215605,1),('field:node:274','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215605,1),('field:node:275','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:905:\"<p>He has been performing comedy since the age of 18 and has been good at it since the age of 22.  His love of comedy began as a two-year-old when he would gurgle in delight at Alexei Sayle’s face, later his comedy, and he spent his formative years obsessed with George Carlin and Bill Hicks. He has just returned from a comedy tour of Croatia and will soon be on the road with Mumford And Sons on their Gentlemen Of The Road tour. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>This will be his fourth year at Edinburgh, having previously performed in 2009’s youth package show The Lunchtime Club, in 2010 and last year with his debut hour ‘The Love You Take’ which received two excellent reviews, one good and one average. He is an alternative comedian obsessed with truth and morality and a hatred of the world’s fixation with fame and profit. . . He has twice appeared on talking-head shows on both BBC2 and BBC3 for money.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:903:\"<p>He has been performing comedy since the age of 18 and has been good at it since the age of 22.  His love of comedy began as a two-year-old when he would gurgle in delight at Alexei Sayle’s face, later his comedy, and he spent his formative years obsessed with George Carlin and Bill Hicks. He has just returned from a comedy tour of Croatia and will soon be on the road with Mumford And Sons on their Gentlemen Of The Road tour. </p>\n\n<p>This will be his fourth year at Edinburgh, having previously performed in 2009’s youth package show The Lunchtime Club, in 2010 and last year with his debut hour ‘The Love You Take’ which received two excellent reviews, one good and one average. He is an alternative comedian obsessed with truth and morality and a hatred of the world’s fixation with fame and profit. . . He has twice appeared on talking-head shows on both BBC2 and BBC3 for money.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"157\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Alfie Brown\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Alfie Brown\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"388\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:31:\"Alfie Brown publicity photo.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:55:\"public://artistes-image/Alfie Brown publicity photo.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"32102\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1394787315\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411223557,1),('field:node:276','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:114:\"<strong>Courtesy of PBJ Management, Danny’s Comedy Club welcomes this month’s headliner, Alfie Brown.</strong>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:114:\"<strong>Courtesy of PBJ Management, Danny’s Comedy Club welcomes this month’s headliner, Alfie Brown.</strong>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411275606,1),('field:node:277','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:420:\"<p>Hailing from West London and ping-ponging between cultures has left her with no choice but to stand up and laugh about her strict & strange upbringing. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>A storyteller; she touches on topics including race, religion, dating and family. Bisha\'s laid-back charm, along with her ability to surprise and delight audiences took her to the Final of the 2013 Funny Women Awards within a year of her first gig.  </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"saf