brell, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"310\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"339\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"34224\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371382837\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:290','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:303:\"Described as a Northern puns/one liner merchant living in Croydon, Chris Ashton has completed over three hundred gigs in less than two years and is now performing regularly throughout the south-east comedy scene. In 2012 he made it through to the semi-finals of the Leicester Square New Act of the Year.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:303:\"Described as a Northern puns/one liner merchant living in Croydon, Chris Ashton has completed over three hundred gigs in less than two years and is now performing regularly throughout the south-east comedy scene. In 2012 he made it through to the semi-finals of the Leicester Square New Act of the Year.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"167\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Chris Ashton\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Chris Ashton\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"667\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Chris-Ashton.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Chris-Ashton.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"57791\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1394897566\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"146\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411221853,1),('field:node:291','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:1