s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:292:\"<p>Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in many venues and is well-known for her amazing work raising thousands of pounds for the British Heart Foundation. </p>\n\n<p><strong>Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome her back, by very popular demand!</strong></p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:296','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:677:\"<p>Winter has a surreal, energetic and interactive style with stories on his Dutch heritage and life growing up in Ireland. A few well-placed gags and a story about an engagement that ended due to his fiancées eating disorder and a solution to a sexual inadequacy he has suffered for many years.  </p>\r\n\r\n<p>His tangential mind ponders the occupation of Holland, Charity Donations, James Bond, Performance, Catholic School Holidays, Essential-ism and a song about an Overweight Fiancée, coupled with a description of foreplay by one who claims to have had better relationships with animals than human beings. He does this using a variety of sketch, music and spoken word.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:675:\"<p>Winter has a surreal, energetic and interactive style with stories on his Dutch heritage and life growing up in Ireland. A few well-placed gags and a story about an engagement that ended due to his fiancées eating disorder and a solution to a sexual inadequacy he has suffered for many years.  </p>\n\n<p>His tangential mind ponders the occupation of Holland, Charity Donations, James Bond, Performance, Catholic School Holidays, Essential-ism and a song about an Overweight Fiancée, coupled with a description of foreplay by one who claims to have had better relationships with animals than human beings. He does this using a variety of sketch, music and spoken word.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"170\";s:3:\"alt\";s:16:\"Winter Foenander\";s:5:\"title\";s:16:\"Winter Foenander\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"451\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:20:\"Winter-Foenander.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:44:\"public://artistes-image/Winter-Foenander.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"72504\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1394899484\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411221853,1),('field:node:297','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:298','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:129:\"Dan has completed six seasons performing in Spain where he has scooped a clutch of awards and will this year be in Corfu, Greece.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:129:\"Dan has completed six seasons performing in Spain where he has scooped a clutch of awards and will this year be in Corfu, Greece.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"172\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Dan Russell\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Dan Russell\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"328\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"494\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Dan-Russell.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Dan-Russell.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"10884\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1395132582\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411223557,1),('field:node:299','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:63:\"Opening the show this month is professional singer Dan Russell.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:63:\"Opening the show this month is professional singer Dan Russell.\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1413702225,1),('field:node:3','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:316:\"Rapidly making a name for himself, this former President of the Cambridge Footlights was winner of the 2010 Chortle Student Comedian of the Year Award and winner of the prestigious Comedy Central Student award in 2011.\r\n\r\nAlso in 2011 stand-out comedian appeared as the stand-up guest on the BBC’s Rob Brydon Show.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:328:\"<p>Rapidly making a name for himself, this former President of the Cambridge Footlights was winner of the 2010 Chortle Student Comedian of the Year Award and winner of the prestigious Comedy Central Student award in 2011.</p>\n<p>Also in 2011 stand-out comedian appeared as the stand-up guest on the BBC’s Rob Brydon Show.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:1:\"2\";s:3:\"alt\";s:28:\"Phil Wang, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:28:\"Phil Wang, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"567\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"850\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"Phil-Wang.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:37:\"public://artistes-image/Phil-Wang.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"99028\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371332915\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:1:\"8\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411217260,1),('field:node:30','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:2:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"81\";s:3:\"alt\";s:54:\"Dan Kington, owner and producer of Danny\'s Comedy Club\";s:5:\"title\";s:54:\"Dan Kington, owner and producer of Danny\'s Comedy Club\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"4752\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"3168\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:9:\"Dan 4.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:30:\"public://shows-image/Dan 4.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:7:\"2955123\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1376661190\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}i:1;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"82\";s:3:\"alt\";s:31:\"Mel, one of our wonderful team!\";s:5:\"title\";s:31:\"Mel, one of our wonderful team!\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"4752\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"3168\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:20:\"Mel Sherbourne 2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://shows-image/Mel Sherbourne 2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:7:\"4057331\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1376661190\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1412200736,1),('field:node:300','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:1728:\"<p>Lenny Peters has been a professional comedy actor for over fifteen years. He has appeared in a number of TV sit coms including LIFE AS WE KNOW IT with Richard Wilson (BBC) and FIFTEEN STORIES HIGH with Shaun Lock (BBC). He has played numerous comedy characters in adverts and on radio. His stage experience covers comic roles as diverse as Algernon in THE IMPORTANCE OF BEING EARNEST, Malvolio in Twelfth Night, Bottom in A MIDSUMMER NIGHTS DREAM and a big fat monkey in APES SOCIETY.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As a stand-up Lenny has appeared at many clubs including The Comedy Store, Up The Creek, The Comedy Cafe, Jongleurs, The Glee, Rawhide, The Frog and Bucket, Jesters, Headliners, Banana Caberet, The Hob, Downstairs At The Kings Head, Upstairs At The Queens Head, Theatre Royal Stratford East, The Chuckle Club, Barnstormers, Soho Comedy Club, The Comedy Club (various venues) and numerous universities, clubs and pubs around the country. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>He has performed with a number of comedy improvisation company\'s including THE LAUGHING CAVALIERS appearing at The Comedy Brewhouse, \r\n FLUXX performing at the Spitz, Camden peoples theatre, candid cafe gallery and other venues, and DANGEROUS LIASONS touring nationally.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clearfix\"><p>His Edinburgh shows include : </p>\r\n<ul class=\"unstyled thumbnails white\">\r\n<li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2007) ,a mix of stand up, sketches and improv, \"COMEDY COCKTAIL\". </li>\r\n<li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2009) a two hander, with Joe Rowntree, \"ONE HOUR COMEDY CLUB\".  </li>\r\n<li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2011) His first solo show, \" ENJOY YOUURSELF-ITS LATER THAN YOU THINK\" </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:1713:\"<p>Lenny Peters has been a professional comedy actor for over fifteen years. He has appeared in a number of TV sit coms including LIFE AS WE KNOW IT with Richard Wilson (BBC) and FIFTEEN STORIES HIGH with Shaun Lock (BBC). He has played numerous comedy characters in adverts and on radio. His stage experience covers comic roles as diverse as Algernon in THE IMPORTANCE OF BEING EARNEST, Malvolio in Twelfth Night, Bottom in A MIDSUMMER NIGHTS DREAM and a big fat monkey in APES SOCIETY.</p>\n\n<p>As a stand-up Lenny has appeared at many clubs including The Comedy Store, Up The Creek, The Comedy Cafe, Jongleurs, The Glee, Rawhide, The Frog and Bucket, Jesters, Headliners, Banana Caberet, The Hob, Downstairs At The Kings Head, Upstairs At The Queens Head, Theatre Royal Stratford East, The Chuckle Club, Barnstormers, Soho Comedy Club, The Comedy Club (various venues) and numerous universities, clubs and pubs around the country. </p>\n\n<p>He has performed with a number of comedy improvisation company\'s including THE LAUGHING CAVALIERS appearing at The Comedy Brewhouse, \n FLUXX performing at the Spitz, Camden peoples theatre, candid cafe gallery and other venues, and DANGEROUS LIASONS touring nationally.</p>\n\n<div class=\"clearfix\"><p>His Edinburgh shows include : </p>\n<ul class=\"unstyled thumbnails white\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2007) ,a mix of stand up, sketches and improv, \"COMEDY COCKTAIL\". </li>\n<li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2009) a two hander, with Joe Rowntree, \"ONE HOUR COMEDY CLUB\".  </li>\n<li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\">(2011) His first solo show, \" ENJOY YOUURSELF-ITS LATER THAN YOU THINK\" </li>\n</ul></div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"174\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Lenny Peters\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Lenny Peters\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"430\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Lenny-Peters.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Lenny-Peters.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"31637\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1397505168\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411221853,1),('field:node:301','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:302','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:792:\"<p>Warm and engaging, Chris Tavner shares his point of view of the world with the audience.  Covering in his sets everything from current affairs to the family, his observational style ranges from dry wit to the completely absurd. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chris is a member of ComedySportz (<a href=\"http://www.comedysportz.co.uk\">www.comedysportz.co.uk</a>), the leading professional improvised comedy troupe in the North West.  A senior member of the troupe for a number of years, his schooling in improvisation means that he can think on his feet with ease, and can also easily adapt to any audience.  His background understandably means that compering is a particular strength, and he is the resident MC for Funtime Comedy, which books a number of comedy nights and events in the North of England. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:790:\"<p>Warm and engaging, Chris Tavner shares his point of view of the world with the audience.  Covering in his sets everything from current affairs to the family, his observational style ranges from dry wit to the completely absurd. </p>\n\n<p>Chris is a member of ComedySportz (<a href=\"http://www.comedysportz.co.uk\">www.comedysportz.co.uk</a>), the leading professional improvised comedy troupe in the North West.  A senior member of the troupe for a number of years, his schooling in improvisation means that he can think on his feet with ease, and can also easily adapt to any audience.  His background understandably means that compering is a particular strength, and he is the resident MC for Funtime Comedy, which books a number of comedy nights and events in the North of England. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"175\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Chris Tavner\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Chris Tavner\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"750\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Chris-Tavner.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Chris-Tavner.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"340729\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1397512994\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411221853,1),('field:node:303','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:304','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:882:\"<blockquote class=\"spaced_description column\">\r\n<p>Ian Lay, Stage and Technical Manager at Danny\'s Comedy Club owns a thriving DJ and Karaoke business. Ian Lay Entertainments cater for Mobile Discos/Karaoke for all occasions with many years of experience and a large sound system is available for any booking if required. </p>\r\n<p>To book Ian\'s services contact him on <a href=\"mailto:discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk\">discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk</a>, or by Mobile on <a href=\"tel:00447813-520275\">07813-520275</a>.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"clearfix column bg-gray padding-20\">\r\n<div class=\"clearfix column\">Contact Details: <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\"><a href=\"mailto:discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk\">discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk</a></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"clearfix column\">Mobile: <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\"><a href=\"tel:00447813-520275\">07813-520275</a></div></div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:874:\"<blockquote class=\"spaced_description column\">\n<p>Ian Lay, Stage and Technical Manager at Danny\'s Comedy Club owns a thriving DJ and Karaoke business. Ian Lay Entertainments cater for Mobile Discos/Karaoke for all occasions with many years of experience and a large sound system is available for any booking if required. </p>\n<p>To book Ian\'s services contact him on <a href=\"mailto:discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk\">discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk</a>, or by Mobile on <a href=\"tel:00447813-520275\">07813-520275</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<div class=\"clearfix column bg-gray padding-20\">\n<div class=\"clearfix column\">Contact Details: <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\"><a href=\"mailto:discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk\">discos@ianlay.fsnet.co.uk</a></div></div>\n<div class=\"clearfix column\">Mobile: <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\"><a href=\"tel:00447813-520275\">07813-520275</a></div></div>\n</div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411235104,1),('field:node:307','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:403:\"<p>Gary started performing his self-deprecating & likeable, observational story-telling stand up in 2010 and has since performed to great acclaim at The Comedy Store, London and Manchester, the Komedia in Brighton amongst many others. He regularly MCs and has also taken two successful shows up to Edinburgh; \"Gags, Songs & Bombs!\" and \"Tales of the Unaccepted\", which garnered 5 and 4 star reviews.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:411:\"<p>Gary started performing his self-deprecating &amp; likeable, observational story-telling stand up in 2010 and has since performed to great acclaim at The Comedy Store, London and Manchester, the Komedia in Brighton amongst many others. He regularly MCs and has also taken two successful shows up to Edinburgh; \"Gags, Songs &amp; Bombs!\" and \"Tales of the Unaccepted\", which garnered 5 and 4 star reviews.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"179\";s:3:\"alt\";s:8:\"Gary Tro\";s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Gary Tro\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"449\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"332\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Gary-Tro-2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Gary-Tro-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"65976\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401272507\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"180\";s:3:\"alt\";s:8:\"Gary Tro\";s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Gary Tro\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"600\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"840\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:12:\"Gary-Tro.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:45:\"public://artistes-multiple-image/Gary-Tro.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"216782\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401272507\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0: