32:\"<p>With a deadpan delivery and sometimes surreal take on things, multiple award winner Pete has performed all over the UK alongside some of the biggest names in comedy, including Reginald D. Hunter, Ian Stone and Micky Flanagan.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:232:\"<p>With a deadpan delivery and sometimes surreal take on things, multiple award winner Pete has performed all over the UK alongside some of the biggest names in comedy, including Reginald D. Hunter, Ian Stone and Micky Flanagan.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"25\";s:3:\"alt\";s:62:\"Pete Beckley, Reading Comedy Festival New Act of the Year 2012\";s:5:\"title\";s:62:\"Pete Beckley, Reading Comedy Festival New Act of the Year 2012\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"518\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"397\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Pete-Beckley.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Pete-Beckley.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"62500\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371384051\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:3:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"12\";}i:1;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"13\";}i:2;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"11\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:310','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:311','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:199:\"<p>Australian Nick has lived in London for the past fifteen years. Now much in demand on the comedy circuit, he made it through to the heats of the <strong>BBC Radio Comedy Awards 2013</strong>. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:199:\"<p>Australian Nick has lived in London for the past fifteen years. Now much in demand on the comedy circuit, he made it through to the heats of the <strong>BBC Radio Comedy Awards 2013</strong>. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"183\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Nick Elleray\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Nick Elleray\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"944\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"531\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Nick-Elleray.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Nick-Elleray.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"51803\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401272962\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215628,1),('field:node:312','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:313','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:212:\"<p>East London based stand-up and radio presenter, Steve has an energetic style with some cracking wordplay. He has supported top billing acts like Andrew Maxwell, Sarah Pascoe, John Hegley, and Nick Revell. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:212:\"<p>East London based stand-up and radio presenter, Steve has an energetic style with some cracking wordplay. He has supported top billing acts like Andrew Maxwell, Sarah Pascoe, John Hegley, and Nick Revell. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"184\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Steve McLean\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Steve McLean\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"834\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"960\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Steve-McLean.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Steve-McLean.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"72957\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401273602\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215628,1),('field:node:314','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:315','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:755:\"<p>Zahra hit the stand-up scene in 2011 and has since been a 2013 Bath New Act of The Year Finalist, a Funny Woman (in association with Company Magazine) Finalist, Laughing Horse New Act at Brighton Fringe Finalist, Comedy Cafe New Act 2012 Finalist, beaten \'The Frog\' at The Frog and Bucket and reached the Semi Finals of The Piccadilly New Act of The Year Competition. She has also gigged with Gail Porter and supported notorious \'Best Seller\' and International Drug Baron (!) Howard Marks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also an actor, she has featured in Radio 4 comedies and the Radio 4 \'Poetry Please Show\' and hosts a weekly Radio Show called \'The She Must Be Joking Show\', a comedy fuelled, topical talk show, mainly poking fun at celebrity and entertainment news.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:753:\"<p>Zahra hit the stand-up scene in 2011 and has since been a 2013 Bath New Act of The Year Finalist, a Funny Woman (in association with Company Magazine) Finalist, Laughing Horse New Act at Brighton Fringe Finalist, Comedy Cafe New Act 2012 Finalist, beaten \'The Frog\' at The Frog and Bucket and reached the Semi Finals of The Piccadilly New Act of The Year Competition. She has also gigged with Gail Porter and supported notorious \'Best Seller\' and International Drug Baron (!) Howard Marks.</p>\n\n<p>Also an actor, she has featured in Radio 4 comedies and the Radio 4 \'Poetry Please Show\' and hosts a weekly Radio Show called \'The She Must Be Joking Show\', a comedy fuelled, topical talk show, mainly poking fun at celebrity and entertainment news.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"185\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Zahra Barri\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Zahra Barri\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"750\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Zahra-Barri.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Zahra-Barri.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"199738\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401273879\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:5:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"157\";}i:1;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"160\";}i:2;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"159\";}i:3;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"158\";}i:4;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"161\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215628,1),('field:node:316','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:319','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:509:\"<p>Comedian and actor Steve moved into stand-up comedy in 2008. Since then he has come a long way, performing to big audiences and mingling with some big names. 2011 saw Stephen go from strength to strength, winning Search For A Star before performing on Sky1’s show Don\'t Stop Me Now. His theatre credits include Captain Hook’s Revenge, Maskerade, Robin Hood, Murder Of Mrs Whyte, Sounds of The Musicals and Erica and Me. </p>\r\n<p>His 2012 Licence To Offend stand up show also toured to wide acclaim.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:508:\"<p>Comedian and actor Steve moved into stand-up comedy in 2008. Since then he has come a long way, performing to big audiences and mingling with some big names. 2011 saw Stephen go from strength to strength, winning Search For A Star before performing on Sky1’s show Don\'t Stop Me Now. His theatre credits include Captain Hook’s Revenge, Maskerade, Robin Hood, Murder Of Mrs Whyte, Sounds of The Musicals and Erica and Me. </p>\n<p>His 2012 Licence To Offend stand up show also toured to wide acclaim.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"187\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"960\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"640\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Stephen-Foster.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Stephen-Foster.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"76326\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401318993\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"199\";s:3:\"alt\";s:14:\"Stephen Foster\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Stephen Foster\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"425\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"526\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:20:\"Stephen Foster-2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:53:\"public://artistes-multiple-image/Stephen Foster-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"15482\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405027484\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:32','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:298:\"All the way from America, Tim is a veteran of over seven hundred gigs.\r\n\r\nHe has appeared at legendary venues such as the New York and Broadway Comedy Clubs, Soho Theatre and the Hop Pole, as well as a highly successful show Every Other Show At The Fringe Sucks at last year’s Edinburgh Festival.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:310:\"<p>All the way from America, Tim is a veteran of over seven hundred gigs.</p>\n<p>He has appeared at legendary venues such as the New York and Broadway Comedy Clubs, Soho Theatre and the Hop Pole, as well as a highly successful show Every Other Show At The Fringe Sucks at last year’s Edinburgh Festival.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"26\";s:3:\"alt\";s:29:\"Tim Renkow, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:29:\"Tim Renkow, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"461\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Tim-Renkow.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Tim-Renkow.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"35295\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371384149\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411571573,1),('field:node:320','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:388:\"<p>Based in Billingshurst, West Sussex, Steve Foster has been on the comedy circuit for four years now and has twice toured with his very own solo show with a third, Excess Gaggage that he will be touring later this year. He won the Sussex Search For A Star in 2011 and was also a finalist on Sky1\'s Don\'t Stop Me Now in 2012. Other TV appearances include John Bishop’s Only Joking.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:388:\"<p>Based in Billingshurst, West Sussex, Steve Foster has been on the comedy circuit for four years now and has twice toured with his very own solo show with a third, Excess Gaggage that he will be touring later this year. He won the Sussex Search For A Star in 2011 and was also a finalist on Sky1\'s Don\'t Stop Me Now in 2012. Other TV appearances include John Bishop’s Only Joking.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:321','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:329:\"<p>Back by popular demand, Pete headed the cast on our first ever show at the Birch Hotel. </p>\r\n<p>With a deadpan delivery and sometimes surreal take on things, multiple award winner Pete has performed all over the UK alongside some of the biggest names in comedy, including Reginald D. Hunter, Ian Stone and Micky Flanagan.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:328:\"<p>Back by popular demand, Pete headed the cast on our first ever show at the Birch Hotel. </p>\n<p>With a deadpan delivery and sometimes surreal take on things, multiple award winner Pete has performed all over the UK alongside some of the biggest names in comedy, including Reginald D. Hunter, Ian Stone and Micky Flanagan.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1414831789,1),('field:node:322','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:477:\"<p>A full-time comic since 2010, John is another hugely popular act bringing to Danny’s Comedy Club a wealth of experience and a great pedigree.</p>\r\n<p>He has performed in ten countries and at 33 cities in the USA including the famous New York Comedy Club. </p>\r\n<p>He is an Edinburgh Festival regular, where he was a semi-finalist at the So You Think You’re Funny Awards in 2011 as well as a semi-finalist at the Leicester Square New Act of the Year in 2012 and 2013.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:475:\"<p>A full-time comic since 2010, John is another hugely popular act bringing to Danny’s Comedy Club a wealth of experience and a great pedigree.</p>\n<p>He has performed in ten countries and at 33 cities in the USA including the famous New York Comedy Club. </p>\n<p>He is an Edinburgh Festival regular, where he was a semi-finalist at the So You Think You’re Funny Awards in 2011 as well as a semi-finalist at the Leicester Square New Act of the Year in 2012 and 2013.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1414831805,1),('field:node:323','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:526:\"<p>Making her triumphant return to Danny’s Comedy Club thanks to a genuine and massive popular demand, west country comedian, actress and writer Laura Lexx is a uniquely gleeful performer who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. </p>\r\n<p>After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the finals of both the Chortle and Paramount student competitions in her first year, Laura has since been a popular act at clubs across the UK and a regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:525:\"<p>Making her triumphant return to Danny’s Comedy Club thanks to a genuine and massive popular demand, west country comedian, actress and writer Laura Lexx is a uniquely gleeful performer who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. </p>\n<p>After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the finals of both the Chortle and Paramount student competitions in her first year, Laura has since been a popular act at clubs across the UK and a regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:324','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:404:\"<h5>WARNING: VERY, VERY FUNNY.</h5>\r\n<p>Incredibly popular when he last appeared at Danny’s Comedy Club in its debut year, Stu is a consummate performer who blends comedy and magic with absolute nonsense.</p>\r\n<p>His offbeat act is intelligent, sometimes surreal... but always baffling and highly entertaining. No cheesy ladies in sparkly leotards, no cute animals, and certainly no shiny bow ties.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:402:\"<h5>WARNING: VERY, VERY FUNNY.</h5>\n<p>Incredibly popular when he last appeared at Danny’s Comedy Club in its debut year, Stu is a consummate performer who blends comedy and magic with absolute nonsense.</p>\n<p>His offbeat act is intelligent, sometimes surreal... but always baffling and highly entertaining. No cheesy ladies in sparkly leotards, no cute animals, and certainly no shiny bow ties.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:325','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:484:\"<p>A relative newcomer, Bristol-based George is currently taking the comedy world by storm and we anticipate a great future for him!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>He’s already gigged with celebrity comedians such as <strong>Phil Nicol</strong>, <strong>Lloyd Langford</strong> and <strong>Rob Beckett</strong> and has just been booked to perform with <strong>Russell Howard</strong> and <strong>Patrick Monahan</strong> later this year. We never tire of saying it … he is definitely one to watch!</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:482:\"<p>A relative newcomer, Bristol-based George is currently taking the comedy world by storm and we anticipate a great future for him!</p>\n\n<p>He’s already gigged with celebrity comedians such as <strong>Phil Nicol</strong>, <strong>Lloyd Langford</strong> and <strong>Rob Beckett</strong> and has just been booked to perform with <strong>Russell Howard</strong> and <strong>Patrick Monahan</strong> later this year. We never tire of saying it … he is definitely one to watch!</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"189\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"George Rigden\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"George Rigden\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"400\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"400\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"George-Rigden.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/George-Rigden.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"27118\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1401954957\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"226\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"George Rigden\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"George Rigden\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"1280\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"720\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:19:\"George-Rigden-2.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:52:\"public://artistes-multiple-image/George-Rigden-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"43985\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1412446418\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}}',0,1412446418,1),('field:node:326','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215628,1),('field:node:327','a:0:{}',0,1411316554,1),('field:node:328','a:2:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:455:\"<div class=\"white column\">\r\n<p>The Show is conducted in the Longley Suite at the Arora Hotel</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Doors open at 7:30p.m and curtain up will be at 8:30p.m.</p>\r\n\r\n<p> Tickets cost £7.00 each. These are available on the door on the night, or in advance from the Arora Hotel reception desk.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>The headline act is <a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"/artistes/jo-public\">Jo Public</a>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:447:\"<div class=\"white column\">\n<p>The Show is conducted in the Longley Suite at the Arora Hotel</p>\n\n<p>Doors open at 7:30p.m and curtain up will be at 8:30p.m.</p>\n\n<p> Tickets cost £7.00 each. These are available on the door on the night, or in advance from the Arora Hotel reception desk.</p>\n\n<div class=\"column\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>The headline act is <a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"/artistes/jo-public\">Jo Public</a>\n</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215801,1),('field:node:33','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:200:\"Hilarious and slightly surreal, Ian has been performing stand up often and successfully since 2009. Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012 and regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:208:\"<p>Hilarious and slightly surreal, Ian has been performing stand up often and successfully since 2009. Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012 and regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"27\";s:3:\"alt\";s:75:\"Ian Miller, Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012\";s:5:\"title\";s:75:\"Ian Miller, Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"451\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Ian-Miller.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Ian-Miller.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"36928\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371384233\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:1:\"9\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411220711,1),('field:node:330','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:512:\"<p>Paul is a natural story teller who will take you back to his times of misdemeanours, mishaps and those embarrassing moments most people would care to forget. Fast establishing himself on the stand up circuit this cockney raconteur has already proved to be a punchy, heartfelt, and earnest comedian.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A smart dressing, quick fire comic, who can turn on the charm when needed. Paul has already shared the stage with some of the country’s finest comics and already been identified as one to watch.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:510:\"<p>Paul is a natural story teller who will take you back to his times of misdemeanours, mishaps and those embarrassing moments most people would care to forget. Fast establishing himself on the stand up circuit this cockney raconteur has already proved to be a punchy, heartfelt, and earnest comedian.</p>\n\n<p>A smart dressing, quick fire comic, who can turn on the charm when needed. Paul has already shared the stage with some of the country’s finest comics and already been identified as one to watch.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"193\";s:3:\"alt\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"250\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"375\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Paul-McMullan.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"25351\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1403473285\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:331','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:108:\"<p>Paul McMullan is the headliner for the <a href=\"/shows/27-june-2014\">Friday, 27th June 2014</a> show.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:108:\"<p>Paul McMullan is the headliner for the <a href=\"/shows/27-june-2014\">Friday, 27th June 2014</a> show.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:332','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:333','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:787:\"<p><strong>Star of John Bishop’s Britain (BBC1)</strong></p>\r\n<p>Totes - amazebald comedy magician and general goofbag, El Baldiniho hits Danny’s Comedy Club with his latest set of under-rehearsed magic japes. Prepare to be amazed by his lack of magical prowess, gaze in wonder as he stops half way through tricks to read the instructions and marvel at his inability to remember a simple script.</p>\r\n<p>As seen in major comedy clubs (Jongleurs, Mirth Control) and music festivals (Camp Bestival, Guilfest) throughout the UK.</p>\r\n<p>EL Baldiniho is sensitively portrayed by TV comedy sketch actor Jason Mannion, as featured in John Bishops Britain (BBC1 Series 1-2) The Mad Bad Ad Show (Channel 4) and Roy Chubby Brown’s “Who Ate All The Pies?” (Universal Pictures Promo) </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:784:\"<p><strong>Star of John Bishop’s Britain (BBC1)</strong></p>\n<p>Totes - amazebald comedy magician and general goofbag, El Baldiniho hits Danny’s Comedy Club with his latest set of under-rehearsed magic japes. Prepare to be amazed by his lack of magical prowess, gaze in wonder as he stops half way through tricks to read the instructions and marvel at his inability to remember a simple script.</p>\n<p>As seen in major comedy clubs (Jongleurs, Mirth Control) and music festivals (Camp Bestival, Guilfest) throughout the UK.</p>\n<p>EL Baldiniho is sensitively portrayed by TV comedy sketch actor Jason Mannion, as featured in John Bishops Britain (BBC1 Series 1-2) The Mad Bad Ad Show (Channel 4) and Roy Chubby Brown’s “Who Ate All The Pies?” (Universal Pictures Promo) </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"194\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"El Baldiniho\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"El Baldiniho\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"500\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"763\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"El-Baldiniho.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/El-Baldiniho.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"104325\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405021175\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:334','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:335','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:614:\"<p>Musical Comedy</p>\r\n<p>Although Hilary is apparently a newcomer to the comedy circuit, you wouldn’t think it. She has the confidence and sharp writing of a veteran act. Charming and somewhat wild, her self-deprecating risqué songs consistently has her audience in stitches.  Described as “Victoria Wood meets Jo Brand, but with a guitar” Hilary Fox is immensely entertaining and fun to watch, from beginning to end.</p>\r\n<p>Based in the South of England, she has performed at venues including Watford Palace Theatre, The Princes Hall Theatre, Aldershot and The Royal Navy Submarine Museum, Gosport.</p>\r\n\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:611:\"<p>Musical Comedy</p>\n<p>Although Hilary is apparently a newcomer to the comedy circuit, you wouldn’t think it. She has the confidence and sharp writing of a veteran act. Charming and somewhat wild, her self-deprecating risqué songs consistently has her audience in stitches.  Described as “Victoria Wood meets Jo Brand, but with a guitar” Hilary Fox is immensely entertaining and fun to watch, from beginning to end.</p>\n<p>Based in the South of England, she has performed at venues including Watford Palace Theatre, The Princes Hall Theatre, Aldershot and The Royal Navy Submarine Museum, Gosport.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"195\";s:3:\"alt\";s:10:\"Hilary Fox\";s:5:\"title\";s:10:\"Hilary Fox\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"546\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"530\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:14:\"Hilary-Fox.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:38:\"public://artistes-image/Hilary-Fox.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"36511\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405024149\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:4:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"187\";}i:1;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"186\";}i:2;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"185\";}i:3;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"184\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:336','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:337','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:554:\"<p>A relative newcomer Mass Nokhas (pronounced “no cash”) has already penetrated several of the nation’s top comedy venues. He has made the finals of every gong show at London’s Comedy Store and numerous other competitions. </p>\r\n<p>He has already been spotted by the industry and has performed alongside top comedy stars Josh Widdicombe, Imran Yusuf, Mark Dolan and Joel Dommett.</p>\r\n<p>According to Mass, “I\'m young and enthusiastic comic tell stories based on real life event that happened to me just seat back and relax and enjoy.”  </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:552:\"<p>A relative newcomer Mass Nokhas (pronounced “no cash”) has already penetrated several of the nation’s top comedy venues. He has made the finals of every gong show at London’s Comedy Store and numerous other competitions. </p>\n<p>He has already been spotted by the industry and has performed alongside top comedy stars Josh Widdicombe, Imran Yusuf, Mark Dolan and Joel Dommett.</p>\n<p>According to Mass, “I\'m young and enthusiastic comic tell stories based on real life event that happened to me just seat back and relax and enjoy.”  </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"196\";s:3:\"alt\";s:11:\"Mass Nokhas\";s:5:\"title\";s:11:\"Mass Nokhas\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"440\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"629\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Mass-Nokhas.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Mass-Nokhas.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"37743\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405024599\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:338','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:467:\"<p>Another regular of the Edinburgh Fringe, Nick is always in demand right across the comedy circuit and has done over 400 gigs around the UK, reached the semi-finals of last year\'s So You Think You\'re Funny competition in Brighton. He returns to Edinburgh this year with his solo show, Nick Hall: Helmet. You will have seen Nick performing on BBC2, BBC3, and BBC Radio 4. He is the star of cult movie night Hot Tub Cinema and hit football show Comedy Commentary.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:467:\"<p>Another regular of the Edinburgh Fringe, Nick is always in demand right across the comedy circuit and has done over 400 gigs around the UK, reached the semi-finals of last year\'s So You Think You\'re Funny competition in Brighton. He returns to Edinburgh this year with his solo show, Nick Hall: Helmet. You will have seen Nick performing on BBC2, BBC3, and BBC Radio 4. He is the star of cult movie night Hot Tub Cinema and hit football show Comedy Commentary.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"197\";s:3:\"alt\";s:9:\"Nick Hall\";s:5:\"title\";s:9:\"Nick Hall\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"250\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"250\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:13:\"Nick-Hall.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:37:\"public://artistes-image/Nick-Hall.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"11842\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405024886\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:339','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:34','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:360:\"Hailing from Wolverhampton, Jack Kirwan combines an instantly likeable demeanour and a punch line laden set with some great one liners. \r\n\r\nHe has earned a reputation considered good enough by three separate promoters to feature in support of the regular stars from Mock the Week, Dave’s One Night Stand, Have I got News For You and Never Mind the Buzzcocks.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:372:\"<p>Hailing from Wolverhampton, Jack Kirwan combines an instantly likeable demeanour and a punch line laden set with some great one liners. </p>\n<p>He has earned a reputation considered good enough by three separate promoters to feature in support of the regular stars from Mock the Week, Dave’s One Night Stand, Have I got News For You and Never Mind the Buzzcocks.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"28\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Jack Kirwan, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Jack Kirwan, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"408\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Jack-Kirwan.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Jack-Kirwan.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"28537\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371384377\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411220711,1),('field:node:340','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:343','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:243:\"<p>A Graduate of the National Youth Theatre, this hugely talented and versatile comedian, actress, singer and musician has appeared regularly on TV, has her own show Get Carter playing live comedy gigs to audiences of more than a thousand.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:243:\"<p>A Graduate of the National Youth Theatre, this hugely talented and versatile comedian, actress, singer and musician has appeared regularly on TV, has her own show Get Carter playing live comedy gigs to audiences of more than a thousand.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:344','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:648:\"<p>Ian Lane won both the Comedy Virgins Max Turner Prize and the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe New Act competition in 2013.\r\n<p>He is a performer on a mission to capitalise on this potent combination of wit and criteria-meeting affability with a set that draws upon absurdist autobiography, obtuse one-liners and Post-It note poems, all delivered with “a general disdain for modern living”.</p>\r\n<p>Ian was also shortlisted for the BBC Radio New Comedy Award 2013. Elsewhere, he has appeared on bills supporting Phil Jupitus, Andrew O’Neill and Rich Fulcher, and in 2013 he made his Edinburgh debut as part of The Men Who Stare At Jokes.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:650:\"<p>Ian Lane won both the Comedy Virgins Max Turner Prize and the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe New Act competition in 2013.\n</p><p>He is a performer on a mission to capitalise on this potent combination of wit and criteria-meeting affability with a set that draws upon absurdist autobiography, obtuse one-liners and Post-It note poems, all delivered with “a general disdain for modern living”.</p>\n<p>Ian was also shortlisted for the BBC Radio New Comedy Award 2013. Elsewhere, he has appeared on bills supporting Phil Jupitus, Andrew O’Neill and Rich Fulcher, and in 2013 he made his Edinburgh debut as part of The Men Who Stare At Jokes.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"200\";s:3:\"alt\";s:8:\"Ian Lane\";s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Ian Lane\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"444\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:12:\"Ian-Lane.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:36:\"public://artistes-image/Ian-Lane.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"40824\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405117748\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"192\";}i:1;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:3:\"193\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:345','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216527,1),('field:node:346','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:120:\"<p>Alex Bennett, a veteran of the Edinburgh Fringe and recent finalist at the Chortle and the BBC New Comedy awards.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:120:\"<p>Alex Bennett, a veteran of the Edinburgh Fringe and recent finalist at the Chortle and the BBC New Comedy awards.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"201\";s:3:\"alt\";s:12:\"Alex Bennett\";s:5:\"title\";s:12:\"Alex Bennett\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"944\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"531\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:22:\"Alexander-Bennett .jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:46:\"public://artistes-image/Alexander-Bennett .jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"38707\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1405117917\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:347','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:405:\"<div class=\"column\">\r\n<p>37 year old Pat has been on the comedy scene for two years now and is in increasing demand as news of his exceptional comedic talent gets around.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<p>\"On a tough night, Patrick\'s composure, energy and perkiness saw him stick out from the other acts. His stage presence is quality, and his writing is good with a view to getting great.</p>\r\n</div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:400:\"<div class=\"column\">\n<p>37 year old Pat has been on the comedy scene for two years now and is in increasing demand as news of his exceptional comedic talent gets around.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p>\"On a tough night, Patrick\'s composure, energy and perkiness saw him stick out from the other acts. His stage presence is quality, and his writing is good with a view to getting great.</p>\n</div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"204\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Patrick Casey\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Patrick Casey\";s:5:\"width\";s:4:\"3456\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"4608\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Patrick_Casey.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:41:\"public://artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:7:\"5935371\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1407525687\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:348','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:177:\"<p>Master of stupidity and nonchalance, Wayne has been entertaining audiences with his conjuring comedy up, down, left and right of the British Isles for over two years now.</p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:177:\"<p>Master of stupidity and nonchalance, Wayne has been entertaining audiences with his conjuring comedy up, down, left and right of the British Isles for over two years now.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"208\";s:3:\"alt\";s:15:\"Wayne The Weird\";s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"Wayne The Weird\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"453\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:19:\"Wayne_the_Weird.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:45:\"public://artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"28910\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1407526385\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215564,1),('field:node:349','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:994:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>The Fabulous Trudi Styles is one of the UK\'s most entertaining and funny female impersonator acts on the cabaret circuit. Conveniently located near Brighton, she is a regular, leading fixture at Brighton Pride and the best clubs in the south-east.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<p>Trudi is ably accompanied by Colin Blanchflower, aka The Pianoman, a Brighton Pride veteran who recently performed as part of the acclaimed Actually Gay Mens\' Chorus and will guarantee her audiences laughter, fun, wonderful outfits and lots and lots of sass!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"column\">More about Trudi at <strong><a href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles\">Trudi Styles</a></strong></p>\r\n<p>More about The Pianoman at <strong><a href=\"/artistes/colin-blanchflower\">The Pianoman</a></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 class=\"column\">Visit their Facebook Page at: </h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TrudiStylesThePianoman/timeline\">https://www.facebook.com/TrudiStylesThePianoman/timeline</a> </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:984:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>The Fabulous Trudi Styles is one of the UK\'s most entertaining and funny female impersonator acts on the cabaret circuit. Conveniently located near Brighton, she is a regular, leading fixture at Brighton Pride and the best clubs in the south-east.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p>Trudi is ably accompanied by Colin Blanchflower, aka The Pianoman, a Brighton Pride veteran who recently performed as part of the acclaimed Actually Gay Mens\' Chorus and will guarantee her audiences laughter, fun, wonderful outfits and lots and lots of sass!</p>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"column\">More about Trudi at <strong><a href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles\">Trudi Styles</a></strong></p>\n<p>More about The Pianoman at <strong><a href=\"/artistes/colin-blanchflower\">The Pianoman</a></strong></p>\n\n<h3 class=\"column\">Visit their Facebook Page at: </h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TrudiStylesThePianoman/timeline\">https://www.facebook.com/TrudiStylesThePianoman/timeline</a> </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1413200159,1),('field:node:35','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:80:\"Hailing from the Midlands, Jack was a recent semi-finalist at the Loaded Laftas.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:88:\"<p>Hailing from the Midlands, Jack was a recent semi-finalist at the Loaded Laftas.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"29\";s:3:\"alt\";s:30:\"Jay Handley, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"title\";s:30:\"Jay Handley, Stand-up Comedian\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"890\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"800\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:15:\"Jay-Handley.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:39:\"public://artistes-image/Jay-Ha