f our first shows... Danny’s Comedy Club is thrilled to welcome back Sarah, now a regular MC for Eminent Banter, Raw Comedy and Edge Comedy nights. </p></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><p>Performing at many of the UK’s top comedy venues, Sarah was Best New Act finalist at the Brighton Fringe in 2012.</p></div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216520,1),('field:node:358','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216520,1),('field:node:359','a:3:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:832:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events. </p></div>\r\n<div class=\"column\"><p>She has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"column\"><p>A multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. Also well-known for her amazing work raising thousands of pounds for the British Heart Foundation, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome her back, by very popular demand!</p></div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:830:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events. </p></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><p>She has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show.</p></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><p>A multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. Also well-known for her amazing work raising thousands of pounds for the British Heart Foundation, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome her back, by very popular demand!</p></div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}s:11:\"field_image\";a:0:{}}',0,1411216520,1),('field:node:36','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:213:\"A likeable and popular comedian with a natural stage presence, Masai has performed all over the UK and was Runner Up at Midlands Comedian of the Year in 2011. In 2012 he was crowned Birmingham New Act of the Year.\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:10:\"plain_text\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:221:\"<p>A likeable and popular comedian with a natural stage presence, Masai has performed all over the UK and was Runner Up at Midlands Comedian of the Year in 2011. In 2012 he was crowned Birmingham New Act of the Year.</p>\n\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:2:\"30\";s:3:\"alt\";s:44:\"Masai Graham, Birmingham New Act of the Year\";s:5:\"title\";s:44:\"Masai Graham, Birmingham New Act of the Year\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"890\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"934\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:16:\"Masai-Graham.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:40:\"public://artistes-image/Masai-Graham.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"150300\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1371384573\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:3:\"tid\";s:2:\"10\";}}}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411220711,1),('field:node:360','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:695:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>Guitar-wielding Jason has cut a swathe of laughter through the UK comedy scene. Performing since 2011 he is already opening shows for a clutch of the country\'s leading comedy clubs. </p></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"column\"><p>A very funny comedian, in 2013 he won the Oi Oi comedy competition in Eastbourne, was a finalist in the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe competition, a semi-finalist in the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Competition, and a semi-finalist in the Golden Jester competition.</p>\r\n<p>He has succeeded in beating the Comedy Store\'s King Gong. He promotes and comperes two professional comedy nights in Erith and Dartford, Kent on a monthly basis. </p></div>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:692:\"<div class=\"column\"><p>Guitar-wielding Jason has cut a swathe of laughter through the UK comedy scene. Performing since 2011 he is already opening shows for a clutch of the country\'s leading comedy clubs. </p></div>\n\n<div class=\"column\"><p>A very funny comedian, in 2013 he won the Oi Oi comedy competition in Eastbourne, was a finalist in the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe competition, a semi-finalist in the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Competition, and a semi-finalist in the Golden Jester competition.</p>\n<p>He has succeeded in beating the Comedy Store\'s King Gong. He promotes and comperes two professional comedy nights in Erith and Dartford, Kent on a monthly basis. </p></div>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"210\";s:3:\"alt\";s:13:\"Jason Simmons\";s:5:\"title\";s:13:\"Jason Simmons\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"300\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"434\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:17:\"Jason-Simmons.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:43:\"public://artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"60364\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1407785469\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}