s the country’s top comedy acts.</p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"216\";s:3:\"alt\";s:14:\"Gabriel Ebulue\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Gabriel Ebulue\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"657\";s:6:\"height\";s:3:\"609\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Gabriel-Ebulue.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Gabriel-Ebulue.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:5:\"45838\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1410693683\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:0:{}s:20:\"field_image_multiple\";a:0:{}}',0,1411215536,1),('field:node:375','a:4:{s:4:\"body\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:\"value\";s:286:\"<p>Former child actor, ex-model and fashion school drop-out. Based in London, Joe makes his way as a performer, writer and all-round hustler. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>A caustic, catty and irreverent wit, Joe crafts old-school jokes around the universal subjects of love, sex, death and the rest. </p>\";s:7:\"summary\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"format\";s:14:\"html_full_tags\";s:10:\"safe_value\";s:284:\"<p>Former child actor, ex-model and fashion school drop-out. Based in London, Joe makes his way as a performer, writer and all-round hustler. </p>\n\n<p>A caustic, catty and irreverent wit, Joe crafts old-school jokes around the universal subjects of love, sex, death and the rest. </p>\";s:12:\"safe_summary\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:11:\"field_image\";a:1:{s:3:\"und\";a:1:{i:0;a:13:{s:3:\"fid\";s:3:\"217\";s:3:\"alt\";s:14:\"Joe Sutherland\";s:5:\"title\";s:14:\"Joe Sutherland\";s:5:\"width\";s:3:\"600\";s:6:\"height\";s:4:\"1194\";s:3:\"uid\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"filename\";s:18:\"Joe-Sutherland.jpg\";s:3:\"uri\";s:42:\"public://artistes-image/Joe-Sutherland.jpg\";s:8:\"filemime\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";s:6:\"439552\";s:6:\"status\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"timestamp\";s:10:\"1410738126\";s:11:\"rdf_mapping\";a:0:{}}}}s:20:\"field_performer_tags\";a:1:{s:3:\"und