getic, captivating and hilarious, Eddie is making his name regularly performing at clubs nationwide and abroad. He appeared onstage at the O2 with Lee Evans during his Big tour and has appeared on television, most notably on Russell Howard’s Good News and playing rock star Bono on BBC’s John Bishop\'s Britain.\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:13:\"news_keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";}}}}s:7:\"og:type\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";s:5:\"#name\";s:7:\"og:type\";s:6:\"#value\";s:13:\"public_figure\";}i:1;s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";}}}}s:8:\"og:title\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"og:title\";s:6:\"#value\";s:11:\"Eddie Twist\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";}}}}s:14:\"og:description\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#