\'s hilarious I\'m Spazticus.\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:13:\"news_keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";}}}}s:7:\"og:type\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";s:5:\"#name\";s:7:\"og:type\";s:6:\"#value\";s:13:\"public_figure\";}i:1;s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";}}}}s:8:\"og:title\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"og:title\";s:6:\"#value\";s:12:\"Malcolm Head\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";}}}}s:14:\"og:description\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:22:\"metatag_og:description\";s:5:\"#name\";s:14:\"og:description\";s:6:\"#value\";s:533:\"Highly recommended by other Club owners, “performance poet and light entertainer” (yes, really!) Malcolm has won awards and stuff. He supported celebrity comedian Paul Foot on nationa