";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:19:\"metatag_description\";s:5:\"#name\";s:11:\"description\";s:6:\"#value\";s:1305:\"A Graduate of the National Youth Theatre, this hugely talented and versatile comedian, actress, singer and musician has appeared regularly on TV, has her own show Get Carter playing live comedy gigs to audiences of more than a thousand.\n\n\nJoy Carter (http://joycarter.co.uk) is an EMMA award (*Ethnic multicultural media award) nominated musical stand up comedian. She has also appeared in successful shows such as ‘The Job Lot’ ITV as well as appearing on countless TV and radio news reviews and broadcasts, most recently for Channel 4 News ‘WT4’, SKY and BBC Breakfast.   Joy is an established full time comedian who started off life with the National Youth Theatre of Great Britain where she discovered her love of comedy. \n\nExpect a fast paced, intelligent and quirky performance leaving you refreshed and full of joy! \n\nWork includes: Funny Women, Voodoo Lounge, Alexander’s (Chester), Buzz Comedy Clubs, Laughing Bag, Side Splitters Comedy, Funhouse Comedy Clubs, Leicester Comedy Festival, The Comedy Café, East Dulwich Tavern, Big Cheese Comedy Clubs, plus many more…\n\nJoy is also a campaigner on adoption issues, using her own story as inspiration for some of her act, and has set up company http://adoptionarena.com to campaign on adoption issues and produce comedy adoption events.\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#t