s:5:\"title\";s:52:\"Chris Tavner | Artiste - at Danny&#039;s Comedy Club\";}}}}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:19:\"metatag_description\";s:5:\"#name\";s:11:\"description\";s:6:\"#value\";s:731:\"Warm and engaging, Chris Tavner shares his point of view of the world with the audience.  Covering in his sets everything from current affairs to the family, his observational style ranges from dry wit to the completely absurd. \n\nChris is a member of ComedySportz (www.comedysportz.co.uk), the leading professional improvised comedy troupe in the North West.  A senior member of the troupe for a number of years, his schooling in improvisation means that he can think on his feet with ease, and can also easily adapt to any audience.  His background understandably means that compering is a particular strength, and he is the resident MC for Funtime Comedy, which books a number of comedy nights and events in the North of England.\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:13:\"news_keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";}}}}s:7:\"og:type\";a:1:{s:9:\"#a