tions and marvel at his inability to remember a simple script.\nAs seen in major comedy clubs (Jongleurs, Mirth Control) and music festivals (Camp Bestival, Guilfest) throughout the UK.\nEL Baldiniho is sensitively portrayed by TV comedy sketch actor Jason Mannion, as featured in John Bishops Britain (BBC1 Series 1-2) The Mad Bad Ad Show (Channel 4) and Roy Chubby Brown’s “Who Ate All The Pies?” (Universal Pictures Promo)\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:13:\"news_keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";}}}}s:7:\"og:type\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";s:5:\"#name\";s:7:\"og:type\";s:6:\"#value\";s:13:\"public_figure\";}i:1;s:15:\"metatag_og:type\";}}}}s:8:\"og:title\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"og:title\";s:6:\"#value\";s:12:\"El Baldiniho\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_og:title\";}}}}s:14:\"og:description\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal