title\";s:48:\"Ian Lane | Artiste - at Danny&#039;s Comedy Club\";}}}}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:19:\"metatag_description\";s:5:\"#name\";s:11:\"description\";s:6:\"#value\";s:629:\"Ian Lane won both the Comedy Virgins Max Turner Prize and the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe New Act competition in 2013.\nHe is a performer on a mission to capitalise on this potent combination of wit and criteria-meeting affability with a set that draws upon absurdist autobiography, obtuse one-liners and Post-It note poems, all delivered with “a general disdain for modern living”.\nIan was also shortlisted for the BBC Radio New Comedy Award 2013. Elsewhere, he has appeared on bills supporting Phil Jupitus, Andrew O’Neill and Rich Fulcher, and in 2013 he made his Edinburgh debut as part of The Men Who Stare At Jokes.\";}i:1;s:19:\"metatag_description\";}}}}s:8:\"keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:8:\"keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:16:\"metatag_keywords\";}}}}s:13:\"news_keywords\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:7:\"metatag\";s:4:\"#tag\";s:4:\"meta\";s:3:\"#id\";s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";s:5:\"#name\";s:13:\"news_keywords\";s:6:\"#value\";s:133:\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\";}i:1;s:21:\"metatag_news_keywords\";}}}}s:7:\"og:type\";a:1:{s:9:\"#attached\";a:1:{s:20:\"drupal_add_html_head\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:6:\"#theme\";s:17:\"metatag_opengraph\";s:4:\"#t