fix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Rob Dumbrell</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/356\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Rob has been a regular on the comedy circuit for the last seven years.</p></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Great stuff! Really funny!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Jason Manford</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance performer_act_first\"  about=\"/node/361\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/361\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/jason-simmons\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Jason Simmons</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/361\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"><span class=\"pull-left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"badge\"><div class=\"clearfix\">Finalist at the Laughing Horse Brighton Fringe</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix\">Oi Oi comedy competition, Eastbourne 2013</div>\n<div class=\"clearfix\">Semi-finalist at the Golden Jester competition</div>\n</span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"column\"><p>Guitar-wielding Jason has cut a swathe of laughter through the UK comedy scene.</p></div></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/jason-simmons\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        The audience lapped him up        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Ellie Taylor (Snog, Marry, Avoid)</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        If he\'s that good now, he\'s gonna be brilliant in a couple of years        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Calstock Festival</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Jason Simmons\" \n         title=\"Jason Simmons\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance \"  about=\"/node/357\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/357\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/sarah-iles\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Sarah Iles</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/357\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Now a regular MC for Eminent Banter, Raw Comedy and Edge Comedy nights, Sarah was also a finalist for Best New Act at the Brighton Fringe in 2012.</p>\n</div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/sarah-iles\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Sarah has the natural ability to disarm an audience of their inhibitions and turn a quiet crowd into a relaxed, giggling mess.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Banter Comedy Club</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        A real privilege to watch her perform.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Eminent Banter Comedy Clubs</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance \"  about=\"/node/358\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/358\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/stu-turner\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Stu Turner</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/358\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>A consummate performer who comes to us highly recommended, Stu Turner blends comedy and magic with absolute nonsense. </p></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/stu-turner\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Stu made the night unique and broke up the typical stand up acts with magic AND comedy that the crowd loved        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Point and Laugh Comedy</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Will Pointing</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Stu combines comedy and magic with great aplomb. Audiences love him        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Way Out West Comedy Club</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Stu is a cut above the usual magician/comic stock        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Comedy Heat</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance \"  about=\"/node/359\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/359\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Tania Rodd</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/359\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        Local girl Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events.</div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            \n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" \n         title=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article>        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n</section><section itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n    <div class=\"akordeon-item-head clearfix\">\n        <div class=\"akordeon-item-head-container\">\n            <header class=\"akordeon-heading decolumn_mini entity entity-show show-show\"  about=\"/shows/29-aug-2014\" typeof=\"\">\n                <h3 class=\"decolumn_mini\">\n                    <a href=\"/shows/29-aug-2014\" class=\"white\" itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 29th August 2014</a>\n                </h3>\n                <div class=\"actions-links fsmall\">\n                    <span class=\"action-link\">\n                        <a class=\"action-link-view btn btn-warning\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/shows/29-aug-2014\">View Show</a>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"akordeon-item-body\">\n        <div class=\"akordeon-item-content\">\n            <div class=\"white column_small decolumn_mini\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/EventVenue\" itemprop=\"location\" itemscope>\n                            <span>Venue: </span>\n                <span><a itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath<span></a></span>\n                        </div>\n            <article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance performer_act_first\"  about=\"/node/349\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/349\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles-and-the-pianoman\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Trudi Styles and the Pianoman</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/349\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Trudi is ably accompanied by Colin Blanchflower, aka The Pianoman, a Brighton Pride veteran</p></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles-and-the-pianoman\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            \n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Trudi Styles\" \n         title=\"Trudi Styles\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance performer_act_first\"  about=\"/node/350\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/350\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/wayne-the-weird\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Wayne The Weird (Wayne Shakespeare)</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/350\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Master of stupidity and nonchalance, Wayne has been entertaining audiences with his conjuring comedy up, down, left and right of the British Isles for over two years now.</p></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/wayne-the-weird\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        outrageous comedian and magician        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Southern Daily Echo</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        No-one in the audience will ever be able to look at rubber gloves and white rabbits in the same way again.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Creative Cow Comedy Club</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Wayne The Weird\" \n         title=\"Wayne The Weird\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance \"  about=\"/node/351\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/351\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Mike Cox</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/351\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>This Sussex based comedian is already making his mark on the comedy circuit.</p>\n</div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        We love Brighton        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Argus</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Genuinely funny        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Argus</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article><article class=\"entity entity-performance performance-performance performer_act_first\"  about=\"/node/352\" typeof=\"\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/node/352\" />\n    <h3 class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n        <span><a class=\"underline pull-left heading_title\" itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/patrick-casey\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Patrick Casey</span></a></span>\n        <span class=\"pull-right\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"/node/352\"> View Performance</a></span>\n    </h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix decolumn_mini\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span10\">\n\n            <div class=\"clearfix\" itemprop=\"description\"><div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"column\">\n<p>37 year old Pat has been on the comedy scene for two years now and is in increasing demand as news of his exceptional comedic talent gets around.</p></div></div>...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/artistes/patrick-casey\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div></div>\n\n            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        I was very impressed        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Andy Kind</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Likeable, engaging and entertaining, Patrick Casey is a standup with his whole future ahead of him. Definitely one to watch!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Russ Bravo</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"span2\" itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Patrick Casey\" \n         title=\"Patrick Casey\" />\n</div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</article>        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n</section>        </div>\n    </section>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"region region-sidebar span4 column_small\">\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <aside class=\"block block-block block-odd widget clearfix\" >\n    \n            <header class=\"column_title\">\n    	<h4 class=\"block-title\">APPEARING IN THE SHOWS</h4>\n    </header>\n        		\n		\n	<div class=\"content column_small\" >\n	  <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n<p>If you would like to appear in the show, please contact us at <a class=\"white\" href=\"mailto:danny.kington@gmail.com\">danny.kington@gmail.com</a>, preferably with a clip of one of your recent performances.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n<header class=\"column_title\"><h4>Our Team</h4>\n</header><ul class=\"unstyled\"><li><a href=\"/team/ian-lay\">Ian Lay Entertainments</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n<aside class=\"widget\"><header class=\"column_title\"><h4>Reviews</h4></header><p class=\"read-more\"><a class=\"white\" href=\"http://www.tripadvisor.co.uk/Attraction_Review-g504221-d3985810-Reviews-Danny_s_Comedy_Club-Haywards_Heath_West_Sussex_England.html\">\nTrip Advisor Reviews</a></p>\n</aside>	</div>\n    \n        	<div class=\"bottom_block_content column_small white\">\n            <div class=\"column_title\">\n    <h3>Danny\'s Interview with Meridian FM</h3>\n    <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n        <div id=\"club-audio\"></div>\n        <div id=\"jp_container_1\" class=\"jp-audio\">\n            <div class=\"jp-type-single\">\n              <div class=\"jp-gui jp-interface\">\n                <ul class=\"jp-controls\">\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-play\" tabindex=\"1\">play</a></li>\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-pause\" tabindex=\"1\">pause</a></li>\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-stop\" tabindex=\"1\">stop</a></li>\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-mute\" tabindex=\"1\" title=\"mute\">mute</a></li>\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-unmute\" tabindex=\"1\" title=\"unmute\">unmute</a></li>\n                  <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-volume-max\" tabindex=\"1\" title=\"max volume\">max volume</a></li>\n                </ul>\n                <div class=\"jp-progress\">\n                  <div class=\"jp-seek-bar\">\n                    <div class=\"jp-play-bar\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"jp-volume-bar\">\n                  <div class=\"jp-volume-bar-value\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"jp-time-holder\">\n                  <div class=\"jp-current-time\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"jp-duration\"></div>\n                  <ul class=\"jp-toggles\">\n                    <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-repeat\" tabindex=\"1\" title=\"repeat\">repeat</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"javascript:;\" class=\"jp-repeat-off\" tabindex=\"1\" title=\"repeat off\">repeat off</a></li>\n                  </ul>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"jp-title\">\n                <ul>\n                  <li>Danny\'s Interview with Meridian FM</li>\n                </ul>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"jp-no-solution\">\n                <span>Update Required</span>\n                To play the media you will need to either update your browser to a recent version or update your <a href=\"http://get.adobe.com/flashplayer/\" target=\"_blank\">Flash plugin</a>.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"column_small clearfix\">\n        <p>\n            <a class=\"span9\" href=\"http://www.meridianfm.com/\"><img src=\"/sites/default/files/resources/Meridian_FM_Logo.jpg\" alt=\"Meridian FM Logo\" title=\"\" /></a>\n            <span class=\"span3\">Daniel Kington, the owner of the club, had an interview just before one of our shows.</span>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</div>	</div>\n	\n</aside> <!-- /block --><aside class=\"block block-block block-even widget clearfix\" >\n    \n            <header class=\"column_title\">\n    	<h4 class=\"block-title\">The Birch Hotel (Venue)</h4>\n    </header>\n        		\n		<div class=\"top_block_content column_small white\">\n            <article class=\"clearfix gray\" itemprop=\"mainContentOfPage\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WebPageElement\">\n    <header class=\"column_title\">\n        <h3>SHOW TIMES</h3>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"row-fluid column_normal\">\n        <img class=\"span2\" src=\"/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/images/icons/shows/1360371788_Single Seater Djinn Chair.png\" alt=\"Seat Icon\" title=\"Shows opening hours\" />\n        <div class=\"span10 spaced_description\">Danny’s Comedy Club has shows on the last Friday of every month. \n        Doors open at 7.30pm, with Curtain-up at 8.30pm.\n        We recommend you arrive early to get the best seats. \n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"column_normal row-fluid\">\n        <img src=\"/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/images/icons/bar/1360397105_bar_beer.png\" class=\"span2\" alt=\"Drinks Icon\" title=\"Reasonanbly priced bar\" />\n        <div class=\"span10 spaced_description\">\n            <p>The Club has a reasonably priced bar with discounts and special offers on Comedy Club nights, served by friendly, professional staff and accompanied by an excellent Danny\'s Comedy Club menu designed by the Birch\'s head chef.</p>\n            <p>The audience are seated informally, cabaret-style, so you won\'t feel conspicuous. </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"column_normal row-fluid\">\n        <img src=\"/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/images/icons/price/1360372090_currency_pound green.png\" class=\"span2\" alt=\"Pound Icon\" title=\"Price for the Show\" />\n        <div class=\"span10 spaced_description\">\n            <p>The Box Office can be found at the entrance to the Club, just to the right of the entrance lobby. Admission is <span class=\"white fx-large\">£7.00</span> per person, payable at the door on the night. </p>\n            <p><span class=\"white fx-large\">Advanced Tickets</span> are also available from the Hotel Reception at any time.</p>\n            <p><i>We regret that we do not give refunds after <span class=\"white fx-large\">9.00 pm.</span></i></p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>	</div>\n		\n	<div class=\"content column_small\" >\n	  <p>Danny\'s can be found just north of Brighton at the Birch Hotel in Haywards Heath directly on the London - Brighton line and just off the M23.</p>\n<p class=\"column_small flarge\">There is ample free parking on site and nearby.</p>\n<p class=\"column_small\"><a href=\"/venue\" class=\"btn btn-info\">How to find us</a></p>	</div>\n    \n        \n</aside> <!-- /block --><aside class=\"block block-block block-odd widget clearfix\" >\n    \n            <header class=\"column_title\">\n    	<h4 class=\"block-title\">Latest Artistes/Acts</h4>\n    </header>\n        		\n		<div class=\"top_block_content column_small white\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid performers-masonry\">\n        <div class=\"span2 align-center decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/richard-stainbank\" class=\"white underline\">Richard Stainbank</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/richard-stainbank\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Richard-Stainbank.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Richard-Stainbank.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Richard-Stainbank_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Richard Stainbank\" \n         title=\"Richard Stainbank\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>        <div class=\"span2 align-center decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/john-pendal\" class=\"white underline\">John Pendal</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/john-pendal\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal_w150.jpg\" alt=\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>        <div class=\"s