8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/388\" class=\"read-more black\">Ian Miller performs at 31st October 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/31-oct-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 31st October 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 31st October 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/performances/ian-miller-amazing-stand-up-comedy-at-birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Ian Miller: Stand-up Comedy, 5 July 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/5-july-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 5th July 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 5th July 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Ian Miller:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Ian Miller\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/ian-miller\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ian-Miller.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ian-Miller.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ian-Miller.jpg\" alt=\"Ian Miller, Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012\" \n         title=\"Ian Miller, Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Hilarious and slightly surreal, Ian has been performing stand up often and successfully since 2009. Finalist at the Laughing Horse New Act of the Year Contest 2012 and regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p>\n</div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Brilliantly funny and destroying the public image of superman with every gig.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Freshly Squeezed Comedy</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Ian Miller has taken superheroes to a new level and with his geeky wit, controls the room and makes us laugh at the stereotypes! One to watch.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Wisecrack Comedy</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Will Pointing</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Performances:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/performances/ian-miller-amazing-stand-up-comedy-at-birch-hotel\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Ian Miller: Stand-up Comedy, 5 July 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/5-july-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 5th July 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%201.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%201.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%201_w320.jpg\" alt=\"Ian Miller, Comedian\"\n         title=\"Ian Miller, Comedian\" />\n    </a>\n    <p>Photo Courtesy of Sara Schouten</p>\n    \n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/performances/ian-miller-amazing-stand-up-comedy-at-birch-hotel\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Ian Miller: Stand-up Comedy, 5 July 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/5-july-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 5th July 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%203.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%203.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Ian%20Miller%203_w320.jpg\" alt=\"Ian Miller, Comedian\"\n         title=\"Ian Miller, Comedian\" />\n    </a>\n    <p>Photo Courtesy of Sara Schouten</p>\n    \n</div>\n\n        </article>\n    </section>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/pete-beckley\" class=\"white underline\">Pete Beckley</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/pete-beckley\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pete-Beckley.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-