core#\"\n  xmlns:xsd=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#\">\n\n<head profile=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml/vocab\">\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/artistes/adrienne-coles\" />\n<link rel=\"shortlink\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/artistes/adrienne-coles\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Danny&#039;s Comedy Club\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/artistes/adrienne-coles\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Drupal 7 (http://drupal.org)\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent.\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent. \n\nAdrienne Coles lived for many years in Forest Row, and is returning to Haywards Heath on the 30th of August. Both her children were born in the Princess Royal Hospital, and further to her divorce in 2010 they moved to Bournemouth, where they are all settled and happy.  It was at this point in her life that she was able to follow her dream of being a stand up comedian, and in the short time she has been on the circuit she has taken it by storm. ‘It is what I was destined for and I am having the best time of my life’. Its the biggest thrill of all to write, and perform material that makes people laugh’.\n\nAdrienne’s original observational material is full of clever word play, strong characterisation and she draws on her many life experiences past and present. Her apparent innocence is soon betrayed by an obvious wicked streak, and herein lies her appeal.  Her set includes audience interaction, and gentle put downs that get great laughs.\n\nAdrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already having started her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where she is MC and has appeared on the bill alongside Sol Bernstein, and for the military with Drew Cameron.\" />\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\" />\n<meta name=\"news_keywords\" content=\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"public_figure\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Adrienne Coles\" />\n  <title>\n      Adrienne Coles , Artistes - Danny&#039;s Comedy Club  </title>\n  <style type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\">@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css?nc78v4\");\n@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/bootstrap/css/bootstrap-responsive.min.css?nc78v4\");\n@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/css/style.min.css?nc78v4\");</style>\n<style type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\">@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/colorbox/colorbox.css?nc78v4\");</style>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"content-language\" content=\"en-gb\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<!--[if lte IE 8]>\n    <script src=\"/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/js/html5.js\" type=\"text/javascript\"></script>\n    <script 