   </header>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ MAIN _______________________ -->\n\n  <section class=\"page_holder container\">\n     \n    <div id=\"content-header\">\n      \n              <header class=\"column_title\">\n            <h1 class=\"page_title\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\">Adrienne Coles</a></h1>\n        </header>\n              \n            <div id=\"breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <div class=\"breadcrumb-page column_small\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\">Adrienne Coles</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/125\" class=\"read-more black\">Adrienne Coles\'s Stand-up Comedy at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/30-aug-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 30th August 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 30th August 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Adrienne Coles:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Adrienne Coles\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\" alt=\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent. </p>\n\n<p>Adrienne Coles lived for many years in Forest Row, and is returning to Haywards Heath on the 30th of August. Both her children were born in the Princess Royal Hospital, and further to her divorce in 2010 they moved to Bournemouth, where they are all settled and happy.  It was at this point in her life that she was able to follow her dream of being a stand up comedian, and in the short time she has been on the circuit she has taken it by storm. ‘It is what I was destined for and I am having the best time of my life’. Its the biggest thrill of all to write, and perform material that makes people laugh’.</p>\n\n<p>Adrienne’s original observational material is full of clever word play, strong characterisation and she draws on her many life experiences past and present. Her apparent innocence is soon betrayed by an obvious wicked streak, and herein lies her appeal.  Her set includes audience interaction, and gentle put downs that get great laughs.</p>\n\n<p>Adrienne has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already having started her own night of comedy in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where she is MC and has appeared on the bill alongside Sol Bernstein, and for the military with Drew Cameron.</p>\n</div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Warm, witty and original, Adrienne Jones always sees the funny side of life        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Ben Elton</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Adrienne’s material showcases a comic who pays meticulous attention to every detail of her set. She is likeable, has a strong yet understated stage presence and is able to gently ridicule the men in her life, the women in her life and most importantly - herself. Definitely one to watch in 2013!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Gag Show</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        On stage she portrays an innocent demeanour that covers  a wicked naughty side that just can’t stop popping out!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Michael Callaghan</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Reviews:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Adrienne Coles</span> probably had the rudest set of the evening, teasing men (and their girlfriends) in the front row and talking about her ex-lover’s toy lightsabre.</p>\n<p>   Finally, headliner Omar Hamdi got an excellent response with his observations about being Welsh-Egyptian and the problems facin...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/review/8\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/review/8\" class=\"read-more\">View the Review</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Adrienne Coles</span> has made a rapid progression on the comedy scene, already presenting her own night of stand-up in Bournemouth, Rib Tickler Comedy, where her clever observation, hilarious audience interaction and jaw-dropping put-downs will guarantee her future as an exceptional comedic talent. Now ...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/3\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/3\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/mark-cram\" class=\"white underline\">Mark Cram</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/mark-cram\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/john-pendal\" class=\"white underline\">John Pendal</a></h5><div class