"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" \n         title=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\" class=\"white underline\">Omar Hamdi</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Omar Hamdi, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Omar Hamdi, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/danny-hoy\" class=\"white underline\">Danny Hoy</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/danny-hoy\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Danny-Hoy.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Danny-Hoy.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Danny-Hoy_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Danny Hoy, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Danny Hoy, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/jennifer-belander\" class=\"white underline\">Jennifer Belander</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/jennifer-belander\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jennifer-Belander.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jennifer-Belander.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jennifer-Belander_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Jennifer Belander, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Jennifer Belander, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>        </article>\n    </section>\n    </div>		</div>\n\n</div> <!-- /block -->	</div>\n\n</div> <!-- region -->          </div> <!-- main -->\n                </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ FOOTER _______________________ -->\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"secondary-menu\" class=\"align-center unstyled\"><li class=\"menu-257 first last\"><a href=\"/terms-and-conditions\">Terms and Conditions</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                        <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n                <p class=\"span6\">\n                    Copyright &copy; <span itemprop=\"copyrightYear\">2014 </span><span itemprop=\"copyrightHolder\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyClub\"><span itemprop=\"legalName\">Danny&#039;s Comedy Club</span></span>                </p>\n                <p class=\"span6 align-right\">\n                    Website Designed by <span itemprop=\"editor\">Aswin Vijayakumar</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer> \n\n</div>    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.5.2.min.js?nc78v4\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclu