ome</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/cylvian-flynn\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/cylvian-flynn\">Cylvian Flynn</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/97\" class=\"read-more black\">Cylvian Flynn at 26th July show</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/26-july-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 26th July 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 26th July 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/372\" class=\"read-more black\">Cylvian Flynn performs at 26th September 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/26-sept-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 26th September 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 26th September 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Cylvian Flynn:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Cylvian Flynn\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/cylvian-flynn\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Cylvian-Flynno.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Cylvian-Flynno.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Cylvian-Flynno.jpg\" alt=\"Cylvian Flynn, Singer\" \n         title=\"Cylvian Flynn, Singer\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Originally a London girl, Cylvian has fronted several bands as well as solo ventures performing at theatres and music events large and small to great acclaim. Inspired by both Soul and Blues music over many years, she has built a great reputation for bringing sparkle to her performances.  </p>\n\n<p>Popular and well known on the variety circuit, she has a large and enthusiastic following in Sussex. </p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                                                    </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Cylvian Flynn</span> is a regular star of the Tim French shows on the Boradway and Victoria Park, performing alongside the likes of Katherine Jenkins. Cylvian has fronted several bands as well as solo ventures performing at theatres and music events large and small to great acclaim. Inspired by both Soul a...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini perform