er a hundred gigs. Serial entrepreneur Dave is also the brains behind a unique venture laying on bespoke ‘paparazzi’ for private parties and events.</p>\r\n<p>Described as \"Genuinely funny\" by the Argus, Sussex-based comedian Mike Cox is alrea...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/2\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/2\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Performances:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/node/39\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Dave Streeter: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/31-may-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 31st May 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Dave-Streeter-31-may-2013.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Dave-Streeter-31-may-2013.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Dave-Streeter-31-may-2013_w320.jpg\" alt=\"Dave Streeter, Stand-up Comedian, 31 May 2013\"\n         title=\"Dave Streeter, Stand-up Comedian, 31 May 2013\" />\n    </a>\n    <p>Photo Courtesy of Dave Peake, Party Pappers</p>\n    \n</