     <div class=\"navigation border_radius\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"main-menu\" class=\"nav nav-pills\"><li class=\"menu-119 first\"><a href=\"/\" title=\"\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-479\"><a href=\"/artistes\">Artistes</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-370\"><a href=\"/shows\">Shows</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-123\"><a href=\"/venue\" title=\"\">Venue</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-255\"><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-256 last\"><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </header>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ MAIN _______________________ -->\n\n  <section class=\"page_holder container\">\n     \n    <div id=\"content-header\">\n      \n              <header class=\"column_title\">\n            <h1 class=\"page_title\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/jack-kirwan\">Jack Kirwan</a></h1>\n        </header>\n              \n            <div id=\"breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <div class=\"breadcrumb-page column_small\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/jack-kirwan\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/jack-kirwan\">Jack Kirwan</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/49\" class=\"read-more black\">Jack Kirwan: Stand-up Comedy, 5 July 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/5-july-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 5th July 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 5th July 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Jack Kirwan:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Jack Kirwan\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/jack-kirwan\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jack-Kirwan.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jack-Kirwan.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jack-Kirwan.jpg\" alt=\"Jack Kirwan, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Jack Kirwan, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Hailing from Wolverhampton, Jack Kirwan combines an instantly likeable demeanour and a punch line laden set with some great one liners. </p>\n<p>He has earned a reputation considered good enough by three separate promoters to feature in support of the regular stars from Mock the Week, Dave’s One Night Stand, Have I got News For You and Never Mind the Buzzcocks.</p>\n</div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Jack Kirwan was so good I had to ask his name, It\'s Jack Kirwan!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The One Show</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Matt Allwright</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Performances:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/node/49\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Jack Kirwan: Stand-up Comedy, 5 July 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/5-july-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 5th July 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Jack%20Kirwan%201.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Jack%20Kirwan%201.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Jack%20Kirwan%201_w320.jpg\" alt=\"Jack Kirwan, Comedian\"\n         title=\"Jack Kirwan, Comedian\" />\n    </a>\n    <p>Photo Courtesy of Sara Schouten</p>\n    \n</div>\n\n        </article>\n    </section>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/pete-beckley\" class=\"white underline\">Pete Beckley</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/pete-beckley\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pete-Beckley.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pete-Beckley.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pete-Beckley_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Pete Beckley, Reading Comedy Festival New Act of the Year 2012\" \n         title=\"Pete Beckley, Reading Comedy Festival New Act of the Year 2012\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/ian-miller\" class=\"white underline\">Ian Miller</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/ian-mil