                     </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has been Booked For:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-info thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/323\" class=\"read-more black\">Laura Lexx performs at 28th November 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/28-nov-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 28th November 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 28th November 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Laura Lexx:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Laura Lexx\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/laura-lexx\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Laura-Lexx.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Laura-Lexx.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Laura-Lexx.jpg\" alt=\"Laura Lexx, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Laura Lexx, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>West country comedian, actress and writer Laura Lexx is a uniquely gleeful performer who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. </p>\n<p>After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the finals of both the Chortle and Paramount student competitions in her first year, Laura has since been a popular act at clubs across the UK and a regular at the Edinburgh Fringe.</p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Next-generation Lucy Porter        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Chortle</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Assured stage presence and very funny        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Lonestar Comedy Club</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Ian Stewart</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Reviews:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Laura Lexx</span> offered an amazing performance. Her interaction with the audience was unbelievably good, finding the funniest jokes about her targets with bewildering speed and getting consistently huge laughs in the process.</p>\n<p>\"Don\'t be so self repricating, but accurate,\" she said sweetly to one au...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/review/10\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/review/10\" class=\"read-more\">View the Review</a></p></div>                    <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Laura Lexx</span>. I was genuinely amazed by her performance. After thinking about her set during the break, I concluded that she must have a super high IQ or something. How else could she get consistently huge laughs from spontaneous observations about audience members? </p>\r\n<p>I had to work on Tuesday, ...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/review/11\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/review/11\" class=\"read-more\">View the Review</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Laura Lexx</span>. A west-country comedian, actress and writer Laura is described as a “next generation Lucy Porter” who indulges her audience in an unrelenting childish attention. After a whirlwind introduction to the London comedy scene which saw her reach the national finals of both the Chortle an...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/5\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/5\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/jo-public\" class=\"white underline\">Jo Public</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/jo-public\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jo-Public.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jo-Public.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jo-Public_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/node/181\" class=\"white underline\">Mickey Nuttall</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/node/181\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mickey-Nuttall.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Im