<div class=\"navigation border_radius\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"main-menu\" class=\"nav nav-pills\"><li class=\"menu-119 first\"><a href=\"/\" title=\"\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-479\"><a href=\"/artistes\">Artistes</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-370\"><a href=\"/shows\">Shows</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-123\"><a href=\"/venue\" title=\"\">Venue</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-255\"><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-256 last\"><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </header>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ MAIN _______________________ -->\n\n  <section class=\"page_holder container\">\n     \n    <div id=\"content-header\">\n      \n              <header class=\"column_title\">\n            <h1 class=\"page_title\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\">Omar Hamdi</a></h1>\n        </header>\n              \n            <div id=\"breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <div class=\"breadcrumb-page column_small\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\">Omar Hamdi</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/132\" class=\"read-more black\">Omar Hamdi\'s Stand-up Comedy at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/30-aug-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 30th August 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 30th August 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Omar Hamdi:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Omar Hamdi\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/omar-hamdi\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Omar-Hamdi.jpg\" alt=\"Omar Hamdi, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Omar Hamdi, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        Professional comedian with a thoroughbred pedigree, Omar has supported A-list stars Russell Kane, Ava Vidal on tour and the great Milton Jones, all heroes of BBC’s Mock the Week and Live at the Appollo.  A regular sell-out at the Edinburgh Fringe, he was a recent finalist at their So You Think You’re Funny awards. He regularly gigs for massive corporate events like GlaxoSmithKline, Oxfam and Ernst &amp; Young where he co-hosted with Nick Clegg’s wife Miriam. Affable and incredibly funny, Omar Hamdi’s is a name that you will definitely be hearing again.</div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        The Welsh-Egyptian headliner delivered non-stop laughs        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Surrey Life Magazine</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Slick, classy and very clever        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Worthing Herald</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        I really like Omar Hamdi’s work, specially the way he deconstructs and subverts what most ethnic comedians do, and surprises an audience.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Now Show</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Mitch Benn</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Reviews:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Omar Hamdi</span> got an excellent response with his observations about being Welsh-Egyptian and the problems facing modern day social cohesion. His outlook was fairly unique (minus a couple of unsurprising jabs at UKIP and the Daily Mail) and his tone was relentlessly positive, which clearly won him some ...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/review/8\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/review/8\" class=\"read-more\">View the Review</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Omar Hamdi</span>, a professional comedian with a thoroughbred pedigree. Omar has supported A-list stars Russell Kane, Ava Vidal on tour and the great Milton Jones, all heroes of BBC’s Mock the Week and Live at the Apollo.  A regular sell-out at the Edinburgh Fringe, he was a recent finalist at their...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/3\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/3\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/mark-cram\" class=\"white underline\">Mark Cram</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/mark-cram\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mark-Cram_1_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mark Cram, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/john-pendal\" class=\"white underline\">John Pendal</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/john-pendal\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/John-Pendal_w150.jpg\" alt=\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"John Pendal, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/eddie-twist\" class=\"white underline\">Eddie Twist</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/eddie-twist\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Eddie-Twist.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Eddie-Twist.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Eddie-Twist_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Eddie Twist, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Eddie Twist, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\" class=\"white underline\">Adrienne Coles</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/adrienne-coles\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Adrienne-Coles_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Adrienne Coles, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\" class=\"white underline\">Tania Rodd</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\" />\n<d