 itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/352\" class=\"read-more black\">Patrick Casey performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/29-aug-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 29th August 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 29th August 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Patrick Casey:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Patrick Casey\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/patrick-casey\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Patrick_Casey.jpg\" alt=\"Patrick Casey\" \n         title=\"Patrick Casey\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"column\">\n<p>37 year old Pat has been on the comedy scene for two years now and is in increasing demand as news of his exceptional comedic talent gets around.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p>\"On a tough night, Patrick\'s composure, energy and perkiness saw him stick out from the other acts. His stage presence is quality, and his writing is good with a view to getting great.</p>\n</div></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        I was very impressed        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Andy Kind</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Likeable, engaging and entertaining, Patrick Casey is a standup with his whole future ahead of him. Definitely one to watch!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Russ Bravo</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Patrick Casey</span> has been on the comedy scene for two years now and is in increasing demand as news of his exceptional comedic talent gets around. One reviewer said that, \"on a tough night, Patrick\'s composure, energy and perkiness saw him stick out from the other acts. His stage presence is quality, a...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/15\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/15\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles-and-the-pianoman\" class=\"white underline\">Trudi Styles and the Pianoman</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/trudi-styles-and-the-pianoman\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Trudi-Styles_0_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Trudi Styles\" \n         title=\"Trudi Styles\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/wayne-the-weird\" class=\"white underline\">Wayne The Weird (Wayne Shakespeare)</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/wayne-the-weird\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Wayne_the_Weird_2_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Wayne The Weird\" \n         title=\"Wayne The Weird\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\" class=\"white underline\">Mike Cox</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>        </article>\n    </section>\n    </div>		</div>\n\n</div> <!-- /block -->	</div>\n\n</div> <!-- region -->          </div> <!-- main -->\n                </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ FOOTER _______________________ -->\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\" itemscope i