>\n            </div>\n            \n                        <div class=\"navigation border_radius\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"main-menu\" class=\"nav nav-pills\"><li class=\"menu-119 first\"><a href=\"/\" title=\"\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-479\"><a href=\"/artistes\">Artistes</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-370\"><a href=\"/shows\">Shows</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-123\"><a href=\"/venue\" title=\"\">Venue</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-255\"><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-256 last\"><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </header>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ MAIN _______________________ -->\n\n  <section class=\"page_holder container\">\n     \n    <div id=\"content-header\">\n      \n              <header class=\"column_title\">\n            <h1 class=\"page_title\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\">Paul McMullan</a></h1>\n        </header>\n              \n            <div id=\"breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <div class=\"breadcrumb-page column_small\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\">Paul McMullan</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/331\" class=\"read-more black\">Paul McMullan performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/27-june-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 27th June 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 27th June 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Paul McMullan:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Paul McMullan\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\" alt=\"\" \n         title=\"\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Paul is a natural story teller who will take you back to his times of misdemeanours, mishaps and those embarrassing moments most people would care to forget. Fast establishing himself on the stand up circuit this cockney raconteur has already proved to be a punchy, heartfelt, and earnest comedian.</p>\n\n<p>A smart dressing, quick fire comic, who can turn on the charm when needed. Paul has already shared the stage with some of the country’s finest comics and already been identified as one to watch.</p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        PAUL MCMULLAN ONE OF THE BEST NEW ACTS TO GRACE OUR STAGE FOR AN AGE        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Jokers Comedy Club</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Gary Jackets</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        OUR COMEDY NIGHT WAS JUST BRILLIANT, EVERYONE THOROUGHLY ENJOYED THEMSELVES, PAUL MCMULLAN WAS BRILLIANT        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Chequers Inn - Wheeler\'s End</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        ONE OF THE BEST UP & COMING ACTS I\'VE SEEN, KEEP AN EYE OUT        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Joke Klub</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        LIKED YOUR STYLE, WE WILL HAVE YOU BACK        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Paul Rogers, Entertainment Manager Gillingham FC</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        YOU ARE REALLY BLOODY GOOD        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Paul Sinha</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        BEST ONE LINE PUT DOWN OF A HECKLER EVER        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Fat Boys Comedy</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        ONCE AGAIN PAUL MCMULLAN PULLS OUT A BLINDER WITH HIS SHARP WIT HAVING US ROLLING WITH LAUGHTER        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Stand-up and Laugh Productions</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        YOU\'RE THE BEST NEW COMIC I\'VE SEEN......NICE STYLE AND GOOD LOOK!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Tucker Comedian</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        VERY FUNNY! NO BOLLOCKS , NO BULLSHIT , JUST JOKES, VERY FUNNY!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Brian Damage</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><p>In the teeth of the economic recession, there is at least one business that continues to thrive.  And that is the business of comedy. Danny’s Comedy Club in Haywards Heath is no exception. Now firmly established on the national comedy circuit, this popular venue recently celebrated its first bi...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/14\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/14\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/gary-tro\" class=\"white underline\">Gary Tro</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/gary-tro\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Gary-Tro-2.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field