       <div class=\"clearfix\">\r\n        <p>Share on:</p>\r\n        <a class=\"share-trigger btn btn-info btn-mini white\">Click to Share</a>\r\n	<div class=\"addthis_toolbox addthis_default_style element-absent share-links\">\r\n		<a class=\"addthis_button_facebook_like\" fb:like:layout=\"button_count\"></a>\r\n		<a class=\"addthis_button_tweet\"></a>\r\n		<a class=\"addthis_counter addthis_pill_style\"></a>\r\n	</div>\r\n</div>                    </aside>\n                                    </div>\n            </div>\n            \n                        <div class=\"navigation border_radius\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"main-menu\" class=\"nav nav-pills\"><li class=\"menu-119 first\"><a href=\"/\" title=\"\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-479\"><a href=\"/artistes\">Artistes</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-370\"><a href=\"/shows\">Shows</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-123\"><a href=\"/venue\" title=\"\">Venue</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-255\"><a href=\"/about-us\">About Us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-256 last\"><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact Us</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                    </div>\n    </header>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ MAIN _______________________ -->\n\n  <section class=\"page_holder container\">\n     \n    <div id=\"content-header\">\n      \n              <header class=\"column_title\">\n            <h1 class=\"page_title\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/pierre-novellie\">Pierre Novellie</a></h1>\n        </header>\n              \n            <div id=\"breadcrumb\" itemprop=\"breadcrumb\">\n          <div class=\"breadcrumb-page column_small\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/artistes/pierre-novellie\" class=\"active\">Artistes: <a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/pierre-novellie\">Pierre Novellie</a></a></div>      </div>\n         \n      \n              <div class=\"tabs\"></div>\n      \n    </div> <!-- /#content-header -->\n\n    <div class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/38\" class=\"read-more black\">Pierre Novellie: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/31-may-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 31st May 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 31st May 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/united-services-haywards-heath-club\" class=\"read-more black\">United Services Haywards Heath Club</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Pierre Novellie:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Pierre Novellie\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/pierre-novellie\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pierre-Novellie-400x600.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pierre-Novellie-400x600.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Pierre-Novellie-400x600.jpg\" alt=\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Vice President of the Cambridge Footlights, sold out at the Edinburgh Fringe and Chortle Comedy Awards finalist 2012.</p>\n\n<p>Coming to us direct from the Isle of Man, Cambridge Footlights Vice-President, Pierre Novellie enjoyed huge success with his sell-out Edinburgh show in 2012 and was a finalist at last year’s Chortle! Comedy Awards. </p>\n\n<div class=\"clearfix column_normal\">\n<div class=\"column_title\">\n<a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\"><h4>PIERRE NOVELLIE at the Chortle Comedy Awards</h4></a>\n</div>\n<iframe width=\"420\" height=\"315\" src=\"http://www.youtube.com/embed/_QqcGfVTHeg\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n</div></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Phenomenal        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >ThreeWeeks</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Slick and slightly offbeat… sometimes redolent of Eddie Izzard        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Chortle</strong></p>\n                <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Steve Bennet</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        An absolute pleasure to watch        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Broadway Baby</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                                <p><i><a class=\"underline\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" href=\"http://www.ckproductions.co.uk/portfolio-item/pierre-novellie/\">Read More About Pierre Novellie</a></i></p>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Pierre Novellie</span> is no less than a former Vice-President of the Cambridge Footlights and national comedy awards finalist. He enjoyed huge success with his sell-out Edinburgh Fringe show last year.</p>\r\n<p>Joy Carter is a Graduate of the National Youth Theatre. This hugely talented and versatile comed...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/2\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/2\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Performances:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/node/38\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Pierre Novellie: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/31-may-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 31st May 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Pierre-Novellie-31-may-2013.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Pierre-Novellie-31-may-2013.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Pierre-Novellie-31-may-2013_w320.jpg\" alt=\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian, 31 May 2013\"\n         title=\"Pierre Novellie, Stand-up Comedian, 31 May 2013\" />\n    </a>\n    <p>Photo Courtesy of Dave Peake, Party Pappers</p>\n    \n</div>\n\n        </article>\n    </section>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/a