y\" />\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Drupal 7 (http://drupal.org)\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We are thrilled to welcome the phenomenally talented comedian, musician, writer and broadcaster Rosie Wilby. As a comedian, she has performed at Sydney Mardi Gras, The Comedy Store, Latitude Festival and on Radio 4.  As a musician she has performed at the Glastonbury Festival, Ronnie Scotts and on Carlton TV.\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"We are thrilled to welcome the phenomenally talented comedian, musician, writer and broadcaster Rosie Wilby. As a comedian, she has performed at Sydney Mardi Gras, The Comedy Store, Latitude Festival and on Radio 4.  As a musician she has performed at the Glastonbury Festival, Ronnie Scotts and on Carlton TV. \nRosie first tried stand up comedy in 2004 after encouragement from fans at music gigs who enjoyed her between song banter. Her CV now reads like a who’s who of the country’s top comedy venues. She also comperes and curates Femmes by the Thames at Royal Vauxhall Tavern and has appeared on Radio 4’s Loose Ends.\" />\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\" />\n<meta name=\"news_keywords\" content=\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, performance, acts, theater\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"public_figure\" />\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Rosie Wilby\" />\n  <title>\n      Rosie Wilby , Artistes - Danny&#039;s Comedy Club  </title>\n  <style type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\">@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css?nc78v4\");\n@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/bootstrap/css/bootstrap-responsive.min.css?nc78v4\");\n@import url(\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/all/themes/md_minima