rfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/41\" class=\"read-more black\">Sarah Iles: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/31-may-2013\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 31st May 2013</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 31st May 2013</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/united-services-haywards-heath-club\" class=\"read-more black\">United Services Haywards Heath Club</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/287\" class=\"read-more black\">Sarah Iles performs at the 2014, March 28 Show</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/28-march-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 28th March 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 28th March 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/357\" class=\"read-more black\">Sarah Iles performs at the 5th September 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/5-sept-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 5th September 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 5th September 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/arora-gatwick-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Arora (Gatwick) Hotel</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Sarah Iles:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Sarah Iles\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/sarah-iles\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\" alt=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Now a regular MC for Eminent Banter, Raw Comedy and Edge Comedy nights, Sarah was also a finalist for Best New Act at the Brighton Fringe in 2012.</p>\n</div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Sarah has the natural ability to disarm an audience of their inhibitions and turn a quiet crowd into a relaxed, giggling mess.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Banter Comedy Club</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        A real privilege to watch her perform.        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Eminent Banter Comedy Clubs</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Sarah Iles</span>, who is a popular MC for Eminent Banter, Raw Comedy and Edge Comedy nights. Performing at many of the UK’s top comedy venues, Sarah was Best New Act finalist at the Brighton Fringe in 2012.</p>\n\n<p>Another act to have received a standing ovation previously, is Stu Turner, a consummate p...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/16\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/16\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Performances:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span3\">\n    \n        \n    <h4 class=\"decolumn_mini white\"><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\"><a href=\"/node/41\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Sarah Iles: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny\'s Comedy Club</span></a></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;at&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\"><a href=\"/shows/31-may-2013\"><span  itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 31st May 2013</span></a></span></h4>    \n    <a class=\"colorbox-image\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Sarah-Iles-31-may-2013.jpg\"  rel=\"schema:associatedMedia sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/performance-image/Sarah-Iles-31-may-2013.jpg\">\n