class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Stephen Bailey:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Stephen Bailey\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/stephen-bailey\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Bailey.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Bailey.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Bailey.jpg\" alt=\"Stephen Bailey\" \n         title=\"Stephen Bailey\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>We are proud to welcome Steve, who has been the warm-up act for ITV’s Loose Women and is a regular on the Edinburgh Fringe. </p>\n\n<p>He has performed at most of the country’s top comedy venues and has won a number of prestigious stand-up competitions including Brighton’s Laughing Horse.</p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Innovative... warm and affectionate yet no less biting in its wit        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >The Gay UK</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Truly unique!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Jane MacDonald</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div><div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Such an amazing, fresh talent!        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Laura Whitmore</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                                <p><i><a class=\"underline\" itemprop=\"sameAs\" href=\"http://www.stephenbaileycomedy.co.uk\">Read More About Stephen Bailey</a></i></p>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Stephen Bailey</span>, who has been the warm-up act for ITV’s Loose Women and is a regular on the Edinburgh Fringe. He has performed at most of the country’s top comedy venues and has won a number of prestigious stand-up competitions including Brighton’s Laughing Horse.</p>\r\n<p>Nick Root’s passio...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/7\" title=\"Read More\">Mo