	\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/320\" class=\"read-more black\">Stephen Foster performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/25-july-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 25th July 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 25th July 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Stephen Foster:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Stephen Foster\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/stephen-foster\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Foster.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Foster.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stephen-Foster.jpg\" alt=\"\" \n         title=\"\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>Comedian and actor Steve moved into stand-up comedy in 2008. Since then he has come a long way, performing to big audiences and mingling with some big names. 2011 saw Stephen go from strength to strength, winning Search For A Star before performing on Sky1’s show Don\'t Stop Me Now. His theatre credits include Captain Hook’s Revenge, Maskerade, Robin Hood, Murder Of Mrs Whyte, Sounds of The Musicals and Erica and Me. </p>\n<p>His 2012 Licence To Offend stand up show also toured to wide acclaim.</p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                                                    </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini performers-masonry\">\n                    \n\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image-multiple field-type-image field-label-hidden span6\">\n    \n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-multiple-image/Stephen%20Foster-2.jpg\" alt=\"Stephen Foster\"\n         title=\"Stephen Foster\" />\n    \n</div>\n\n                </div>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail 