	\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\" itemscope>\n    <article class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Has Appeared In:</span>\n                <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails\">\n                    \n                        <div class=\"span4 label-success thumbnail\">\n                        <ul class=\"clearfix unstyled image_text\"><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Performance: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/314\" class=\"read-more black\">Steve McLean performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Show: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/27-june-2014\" class=\"read-more black\">Friday, 27th June 2014</a></span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Date: </span><span class=\"white\">Friday, 27th June 2014</span></li><li class=\"column_mini\"><span class=\"black\">Venue: </span><span><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/birch-hotel\" class=\"read-more black\">Birch Hotel, Haywards Heath</a></span></li></ul>                        </div>\n                                        </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About Steve McLean:</span>\n                <meta itemprop=\"name\" content=\"Steve McLean\" />\n                <meta itemprop=\"url\" content=\"/artistes/steve-mclean\" />\n                <article class=\"row-fluid column_mini\">\n                    <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Steve-McLean.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-above\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Steve-McLean.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Steve-McLean.jpg\" alt=\"Steve McLean\" \n         title=\"Steve McLean\" />\n</div>\n\n                    </aside>\n                    <div class=\"span8\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                            <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <p>East London based stand-up and radio presenter, Steve has an energetic style with some cracking wordplay. He has supported top billing acts like Andrew Maxwell, Sarah Pascoe, John Hegley, and Nick Revell. </p></div>                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                            <div class=\"entity entity-pressquotation pressquotation-pressquotation\"  about=\"\" typeof=\"\">\n\n    <blockquote class=\"column_small press_quotes\">\n        Funny, sharp and filled with variety in the best possible way        <p class=\"clearfix column_mini large\"><strong >Reel Rebels Radio</strong></p>\n            </blockquote>\n\n</div>                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                    <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\"><span class=\"label label-warning\">Steve McLean</span> has an energetic style with some cracking wordplay. He has recently supported top billing comedy acts like Andrew Maxwell, Sarah Pascoe, John Hegley, and Nick Revell.</p>\r\n \r\n<p>   Zahra Barri hit the stand-up scene in 2011 and has since been a 2013 Bath New Act of The Year Finalist, a ...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/14\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/14\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>                    </article>\n                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Danny\'s Comedy Club:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\" class=\"white underline\">Paul McMullan</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/paul-mcmullan\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Paul-McMullan_w150.jpg\" alt=\"\" \n         title=\"\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/gary-tro\" class=\"white underline\">Gary Tro</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/gary-tro\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Gary-Tro-2.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Gary-Tro-2.j