rtlink\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/node/359\" />\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Danny&#039;s Comedy Club\" />\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/node/359\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/node/359\" />\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events. \nShe has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show.\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events. \nShe has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show.\nA multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. Also well-known for her amazing work raising thousands of pounds for the British Heart Foundation, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome her back, by very popular demand!\" />\n<meta content=\"Tania Rodd performs at 5th September 2014\" about=\"/node/359\" property=\"schema:name\" />\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"Stand-up Comedy, Music, Singing, Singer, Comedian, stage, microphone, Comedy Clubs, Entertainment, Comics, perf