v class=\"column clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n          <div id=\"main\" class=\"\">\n            <div class=\"region region-content\">\n\n	<div class=\"content\">\n	  <div class=\"block block-system block-odd widget clearfix\">\n                		\n		<div class=\"content\" >\n		  <div class=\"clearfix column node node-performances\"  about=\"/node/359\" typeof=\"schema:CreativeWork sioc:Role\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyEvent\">\n    <h3 class=\"white\">\n        <span itemprop=\"performer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Person\">\n            <a itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Tania Rodd</span></a>\n        </span> in \n        <span itemprop=\"superEvent\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Event\">\n            <a itemprop=\"url\" href=\"/shows/5-sept-2014\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Friday, 5th September 2014</span></a>\n        </span> at \n        Danny\'s Comedy Club    </h3>\n    \n    <section class=\"row-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"span8\">\n            <aside class=\"align-center column_small\">\n                <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n                                    </div>\n            </aside>\n            <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Performer:</span>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                <ul class=\"act-tags\"><li class=\"act-tag pull-left white\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\">Tania Rodd</a></li></ul>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Date:</span>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                <ul class=\"act-tags\"><li class=\"act-tag pull-left white\">Friday, 5th September 2014</li></ul>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Show:</span>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                <ul class=\"act-tags\"><li class=\"act-tag pull-left white\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/shows/5-sept-2014\">Friday, 5th September 2014</a></li></ul>                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">Venue for the Show:</span>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                <ul class=\"act-tags\"><li class=\"act-tag pull-left white\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/venue/arora-gatwick-hotel\">Arora (Gatwick) Hotel</a></li></ul>                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n                        <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About:</span>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                    <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"column\"><p>Well-known and hugely popular local singer Tania has performed in the West End and across the UK, including performances at the House of Lords and some of the Royal Jubilee events. </p></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><p>She has also appeared at venues in Europe and the United States in various Musicals, shows and concerts.  These include the musical Buddy, The Patsy Cline Story, Return to the Forbidden Planet, Sweet Charity and The Rocky Horror Picture Show.</p></div>\n<div class=\"column\"><p>A multi-talented musician, Tania plays the saxophone, flute, clarinet and piano and often likes to combine these with singing. Also well-known for her amazing work raising thousands of pounds for the British Heart Foundation, Danny’s Comedy Club is privileged to welcome her back, by very popular demand!</p></div></div>                </div>\n                <div class=\"clearfix\">\n                                    </div>\n            </article>\n                    </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n                        <header class=\"column_title column_sm