t at comedy clubs up and down the country....<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>        </article>\n                    </div>\n                    </aside>\n            </section>\n    \n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performances at the Show:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performances-masonry\">\n            <ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/371\">Sheraz Yousef performs at 26th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/372\">Cylvian Flynn performs at 26th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/376\">Joe Sutherland performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/379\">Mat Wills performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"underline\" href=\"/node/384\">Murray Porter performs at the club</a></li></ul>        </article>\n    </section>\n        <section class=\"row-fluid column\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Co-Performers at the Show:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <article class=\"row column_mini performers-masonry\">\n            <div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/sheraz-yousef\" class=\"white underline\">Sheraz Yousef</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/sheraz-yousef\"><meta itemprop=\"ima