mooney\" class=\"white underline\">Michael Mooney</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/michael-mooney\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Michael-Mooney.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Michael-Mooney.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Michael-Mooney_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Michael Mooney, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Michael Mooney, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\" class=\"white underline\">Mike Cox</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/ronnie-rialto\" class=\"white underline\">Ronnie Rialto</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/ronnie-rialto\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ronnie-Rialto.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ronnie-Rialto.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Ronnie-Rialto_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Ronnie Rialto, Singer\" \n         title=\"Ronnie Rialto, Singer\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\" class=\"white underline\">Rob Dumbrell</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>        </article>\n    </section>\n    </div>		</div>\n\n</div> <!-- /block -->	</div>\n\n</div> <!-- region -->          </div> <!-- main -->\n                </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ______________________ FOOTER _______________________ -->\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/WPFooter\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"clearfix\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement\">\n                <ul id=\"secondary-menu\" class=\"align-center unstyled\"><li class=\"menu-257 first last\"><a href=\"/terms-and-conditions\">Terms and Conditions</a></li>\n</ul>            </div>\n                        <div class=\"row-fluid\">\n                <p class=\"span6\">\n                    Copyright &copy; <span itemprop=\"copyrightYear\">2014 </span><span itemprop=\"copyrightHolder\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ComedyClub\"><span itemprop=\"legalName\">Danny&#039;s Comedy Club</span></span>                </p>\n                <p class=\"span6 align-right\">\n                    Website Designed by <span itemprop=\"editor\">Aswin Vijayakumar</span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer> \n\n</div>    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://code.jquery.com/jquery-1.5.2.min.js?nc78v4\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/packages/colorbox/jquery.colorbox.js?nc78v4\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/all/themes/md_minimal/js/script.js?nc78v4\"></script>\n    <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/misc/jquery.once.js?v=1.2\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/misc/drupal.js?nc78v4\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n<!--//--><![CDATA[//><!--\njQuery.extend(Drupal.settings, {\"basePath\":\"\\/\",\"pathPrefix\":\"\",\"ajaxPageState\":{\"theme\":\"md_minimal\",\"theme_token\":\"sYDrGjYWo_ymLFQ6fq_qoz_GzHUS5XGqXaBbZH_g9Gw\",\"js\":{\"http:\\/\\/code.jquery.com\\/jquery-1.5.2.min.js\":1,\"sites\\/default\\/packages\\/colorbox\\/jquery.colorbox.js\":1,\"sites\\/all\\/themes\\/md_minimal\\/js\\/script.js\":1,\"misc\\/jquery.once.js\":1,\"misc\\/drupal.js\":1},\"css\":{\"sites\\/default\\/packages\\/bootstrap\\/css\\/bootstrap.min.css\":1,\"sites\\/default\\/packages\\/bootstrap\\/css\\/bootstrap-responsive.min.css\":1,\"sites\\/all\\/themes\\/md_minimal\\/css\\/style.min.css\":1,\"sites\\/default\\/packages\\/colorbox\\/colorbox.css\":1}}});\n//--><!]]>\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\";s:5:\"title\";s:68:\"Joy Carter: Stand-up Comedy, 31 May 2013 at Danny&#039;s Comedy Club\";s:7:\"headers\";a:4:{s:12:\"Content-Type\";s:24:\"text/html; charset=utf-8\";s:16:\"Content-Language\";s:2:\"en\";s:4:\"Link\";s:117:\"<http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/no