on the door on the night, or in advance from the Birch Hotel reception desk.</p></div>                </article>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                            <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n        <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\">SALSA AND A TOUCH OF LONDON COMES TO POPULAR SUSSEX COMEDY CLUB\n\n<p>A plethora of talent erupts once again at popular Haywards Heath entertainment venue Danny\'s Comedy Club this month. Another top-drawer line up of comedians has been carefully assembled by the club\'s owner Daniel Kington from acts performing right across the UK.</p>\n\n<p>Spokesperson for the club Mel Sherbourne was quick to point out the pedigrees of those coming to perform at the Birch Hotel on Friday 26th. \"Having become an established venue on the UK comedy scene and with good feedback throughout the industry regarding our audiences and the facilities provided by our hosts at the Birch, we are attracting enquiries from all...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/17\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>        </article>\n                        </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n        <span class=\"white\">Performances:</span>\n        <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails performances-masonry\">\n            <ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/371\">Sheraz Yousef performs at 26th September 2014</a></li></ul><u