edyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jo-Public_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Jo Public, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\" class=\"white underline\">Mike Cox</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/mike-cox\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Mike-Cox_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Mike Cox, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/nigel-lovell\" class=\"white underline\">Nigel Lovell </a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/nigel-lovell\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Nigel-Lovell.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Nigel-Lovell.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Nigel-Lovell_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Nigel Lovell \" \n         title=\"Nigel Lovell \" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\" class=\"white underline\">Rob Dumbrell</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/rob-dumbrell\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Rob-Dumbrell_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Rob Dumbrell, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/jason-simmons\" class=\"white underline\">Jason Simmons</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/jason-simmons\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Jason-Simmons_0_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Jason Simmons\" \n         title=\"Jason Simmons\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/sarah-iles\" class=\"white underline\">Sarah Iles</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/sarah-iles\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Sarah-Iles_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Sarah Iles, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/stu-turner\" class=\"white underline\">Stu Turner</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/stu-turner\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Stu-Turner_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\" \n         title=\"Stu Turner, Stand-up Comedian\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div><div class=\"span2 thumbnail decolumn_small\"><h5><a href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\" class=\"white underline\">Tania Rodd</a></h5><div class=\"column_mini\"><a class=\"clearfix\" href=\"/artistes/tania-rodd\"><meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\" />\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-image field-type-image field-label-hidden\"  property=\"sioc:link foaf:depicts dcmit:Image\" resource=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd.jpg\">\n    <img src=\"http://www.dannyscomedyclub.com/sites/default/files/artistes-image/Tania-Rodd_w150.jpg\" alt=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" \n         title=\"Tania Rodd, Musician\" />\n</div>\n</a></div></div>                </div>\n            </div>\n                        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n                <span class=\"white\">About the show:</span>\n                <article class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                    <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"white column\">\n<p>The Show is conducted in the Longley Suite at the Arora Hotel</p>\n\n<p>Doors open at 7:30p.m and curtain up will be at 8:30p.m.</p>\n\n<p> Tickets cost £7.00 each. These are available on the door on the night, or in advance from the Arora Hotel reception desk.</p>\n\n<div class=\"column\">\n<blockquote>\n<p>The headline act is <a class=\"btn btn-info\" href=\"/artistes/jo-public\">Jo Public</a>\n</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div></div>                </article>\n            </div>\n                    </div>\n                <aside class=\"span4\">\n            <div class=\"row-fluid column_small\">\n                                <header class=\"column_title column_small\">\n                    <h3>Press Releases:</h3>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n                            <article class=\"clearfix column_small\">\n        <div class=\"padding-box hover-view-box white\">DANNY\'S COMEDY CLUB COMES TO CRAWLEY\n\n<p>A popular comedy club opens its doors in Crawley for the first time next Friday. Danny\'s Comedy Club is well-established on the national comedy scene with acts from all over the country regularly performing at its venue in Haywards Heath. Now, the club is set to expand with a second venue at Crawley\'s prestigious Arora Hotel in Southgate Avenue.</p>\n\n<p>Spokesperson for the club, Leanne McLaughlin, said, \"Danny\'s Comedy Club has been doing really well and we have been looking to expand into Crawley for some time now. Our shows always go down well, with audiences returning again and again. We wanted to bring that success to a potentially wider audience...<div class=\"more-link\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/16\" title=\"Read More\">More</a></div><p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"/pressrelease/16\" class=\"read-more\">View the Press Release</a></p></div>        </article>\n                        </div>\n                            </div>\n        </aside>\n            </article>\n        <div class=\"clearfix column\">\n        <span class=\"white\">Performances:</span>\n        <div class=\"row-fluid column_mini thumbnails performances-masonry\">\n            <ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/353\">Jo Public performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/354\">Mike Cox performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/355\">Nigel Lovell performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/356\">Rob Dumbrell performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/361\">Jason Simmons performs at Danny\'s Comedy Club</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/357\">Sarah Iles performs at the 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/358\">Stu Turner performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul><ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a class=\"white underline\" href=\"/node/359\">Tania Rodd performs at 5th September 2014</a></li></ul>        </div>\n    </div>\n        <section class=\"column clearfix\">\n        <header class=\"column_title row\">\n            <h3>Upcoming Shows:</h3>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"clearfix column_mini\">\n            <ul class=\"thumbnails\"><li class=\"thumbnail padding-box label-info pull-left\"><a href=\"/shows/28-nov-2014\" class=\"read-more\">Friday, 28th November 2014</a></li